Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.10,0:00:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go！Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.06,0:01:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yo，Jimmy，man，give me the status.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.87,0:01:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Tell me we good。- We got it，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.07,0:01:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Beautiful。It's gonna be an all-timer tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.58,0:01:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，all right，all right。Fire 'em up！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.68,0:01:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,We go live in five.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.75,0:01:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's time for ignition and straight automobile pimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.45,0:01:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's do it，man。Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.15,0:02:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ow，girl！- Sorry！My bad！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.63,0:02:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，ladies！We're good！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.66,0:02:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.46,0:02:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's it，babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.67,0:02:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Tej。Let's get this race going！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.04,0:02:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa，whoa，man。Wait a second，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.61,0:02:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,You cats are first wave，man。Where's your fourth at？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.08,0:02:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yo，it was Joaquin，but he had to work the graveyard shift。- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.98,0:02:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Graveyard shift，man？Yo，why don't you run with us，Tej？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.75,0:02:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hell，no，I'm not runnin' with y'all，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.02,0:02:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Either you find a fourth or you don't race.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.46,0:02:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How 'bout that，huh？- We should find two…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.56,0:02:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,so we don't have to roll with skirt here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.10,0:02:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,[Spanish]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.70,0:02:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oooh！Idiota.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- [Spanish] - Whoa。Whoa。Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.64,0:02:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why don't I just find y'all a fourth and we settle this on the streets，huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.51,0:03:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Bring him on。- Anybody I want？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.78,0:03:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- [Spanish] - No matter who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.34,0:03:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.19,0:03:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。Yeah，man。You wanna race tonight？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.25,0:03:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah。You know I could use the money。- You got four minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.06,0:03:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。I'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.09,0:03:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,The race starts in four minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.43,0:03:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，girls。Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.94,0:04:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You think you gonna win baby？- What you think？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.77,0:04:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You better。We got rent to pay。- I know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.17,0:04:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,[Spanish]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.34,0:04:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll get you when you get a car worth racing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.38,0:04:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。There's our fourth right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.55,0:04:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit。It's Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.08,0:05:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，Brian.！I love you，Bullet.！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.41,0:05:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's up，Tej？- What's happenin'，dude？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.78,0:05:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thanks for the invite。- No problem at all，man。Just，uh
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.92,0:05:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just remember me when you wax，a'ight？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They got deep pockets？- Real deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.10,0:05:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's up，Suki？- What's up，Bullet？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.37,0:05:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What do you say we kick it a nickel？- [Spanish]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.24,0:05:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nobody said nothin' about raisin' the stakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.01,0:05:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,If that's the case，why don't you ask these nice people here…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.88,0:05:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- to back off the line so you can go home？- Oooh！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.55,0:05:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey。Hey。Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.73,0:06:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。Thirty-five large.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.16,0:06:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,[Spanish]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.00,0:06:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,[Spanish]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.41,0:06:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thirty-five large，huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.94,0:06:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Either that or you can go home，brah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.94,0:06:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.42,0:06:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's all there。- It better be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.72,0:06:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn，Suki。Uh，when you gonna pop my clutch，huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.32,0:06:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,As soon as you get the right set of tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.29,0:06:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，a'ight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.91,0:07:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，back up。Back up。Let's go。Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.35,0:07:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.35,0:07:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Back y'all asses up。Back up。Back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.42,0:07:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Before you turn into barbecue around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.62,0:07:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not a game。This is serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.96,0:07:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。Back up。Back up。Get off the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.79,0:07:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go。Back it up。Back it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.80,0:07:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everybody keep your hands real，real clear，all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.33,0:07:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,'Cause I got a surprise for y'all this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.67,0:07:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Go，SlapJack！Go，baby！- I got this。I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.37,0:07:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,[Spanish]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.62,0:07:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.85,0:07:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.02,0:07:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.02,0:07:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.35,0:07:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.67,0:08:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，hell，no！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.05,0:08:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aaah！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.62,0:08:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aha！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.02,0:08:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,You ain't passin' me，dawg。You ain't passin' me。Come on！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.46,0:08:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,What you got，man？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.87,0:09:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you you weren't gonna pass me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.98,0:09:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Move，bitch！- Ha！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.84,0:09:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pendeja.！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.43,0:10:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,[Spanish] Uh uh。Not tonight，baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.30,0:10:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bend over，boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.67,0:10:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn，girl！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.49,0:10:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Last turn。Last turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.73,0:10:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，too wide！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.17,0:10:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Home stretch，baby！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.05,0:10:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoo-h-h-hoo！Let it go，dawg！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.43,0:11:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,[Spanish]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.83,0:11:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.24,0:11:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,[Spanish]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.55,0:11:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can smell you！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.18,0:11:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yo，Jimmy，hit it，baby。Hit it！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.89,0:11:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,A'ight。Y'all see that？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.93,0:11:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Told y'all I had a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.06,0:11:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,How you like that for a finale？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.27,0:11:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.44,0:12:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh！- Whoo-hoo！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.95,0:12:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.76,0:12:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.77,0:12:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Huh？Oh，hell，no！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.04,0:13:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoo！Smack that ass！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.83,0:13:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.68,0:13:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell me y'all saw that，man。Bullet and Suki sprayed the bridge，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.81,0:13:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,and I need to start making y'all pay to see this shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.68,0:13:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got over 10 stacks for my man right here，a'ight？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.95,0:13:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what I'm talkin' about，man。play with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.12,0:13:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Smells good，don't it？- Yeah，I'll buy that。Right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.69,0:13:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。Y'all see this？Everybody take a real good look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.16,0:13:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,This what you call mutual respect。A'ight，let's clear out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.50,0:13:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anybody down for another race？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.87,0:14:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.07,0:14:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，uh，make sure you bring that body by the garage later，a'ight，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.11,0:14:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,so，you know，we can work on that front end of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.51,0:14:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch out。'Cause maybe I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.72,0:14:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.85,0:14:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's up，man？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.62,0:14:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，where you going？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.36,0:14:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's time to get out of here。- Why's that？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.29,0:14:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.13,0:15:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nissan Skyline。Got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.48,0:15:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！Shit！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.52,0:15:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.76,0:15:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.97,0:15:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.84,0:15:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me see your hands！put 'em up！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.88,0:15:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is him。We got him.！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.33,0:16:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- So，how long you been in south Florida？- A while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.80,0:16:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Before that？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.87,0:16:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,We know you're Brian O'Conner，formerly of the L.A.p.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.57,0:16:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You've got the wrong guy。- Really？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.35,0:16:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,How you doin; O'Conner？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.72,0:16:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's take a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.16,0:16:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Carter Verone。Born in Argentina.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.06,0:16:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,But he's lived most of his life in Miami.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.56,0:16:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now he owns the biggest import/ export business in the state.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.37,0:16:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Unfortunately，the cartels have been successful getting drugs into Miami.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.70,0:16:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,But they've had a hard time gettin' the cash out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.84,0:16:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've been surveilling him for a year，but we've never been able…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.01,0:16:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,to put him and the money together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.01,0:16:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We've swept his house，his warehouses - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.41,0:17:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Customs here has done a great job of getting us this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.25,0:17:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm just here to help get them over the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.59,0:17:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was able to get an agent in undercover…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.59,0:17:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,working travel and logistics for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.89,0:17:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Recently，Verone put her in charge of finding some new drivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.06,0:17:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Right。Although we can't confirm her status right now。- You think she's flipped？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.26,0:17:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's one of mine。She's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.63,0:17:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's been in with Verone nearly a year。Even lives at the compound with him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.30,0:17:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，it was the F.B.I.'s idea to bring you in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.54,0:17:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm against it。But we need some good drivers…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.98,0:17:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,that can put this asshole and his money together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.28,0:17:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're gonna roll with Agent Dunn here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.28,0:17:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,And if I don't？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.78,0:17:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，here's a list of the laws you broke in L.A.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.62,0:17:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Obstruction of justice，aiding and abetting。You know the rap sheet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.56,0:17:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，we can make this all go away in the interest of justice，
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.29,0:17:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- if you're willing to play ball。- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.50,0:17:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,So what's the idea here？Dunn and I are supposed to be street racers？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.57,0:17:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.08,0:18:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，Dunn
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.22,0:18:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Looks like we're gonna be partners，bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.22,0:18:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Could you tell me right quick what would be a better motor for my Skyline，
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.59,0:18:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,a Gallo 12 or a Gallo 24？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.23,0:18:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Um… The 24.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.90,0:18:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't know pizza places made motors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.14,0:18:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,See，man，come on。I can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.60,0:18:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seriously，if this is what you're gonna give me，
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.77,0:18:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,I may as well take my chances in Chino.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.01,0:18:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,We will get someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.68,0:18:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,No way，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.25,0:18:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,The only way I'll do this is if I get to pick the driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.39,0:18:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，O'Conner，who you got in mind？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.26,0:18:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,This dude I grew up with in Barstow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.73,0:18:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Who's that？- Roman pearce.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.72,0:19:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh！What
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.95,0:19:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That's your boy in the Monte Carlo？- Yeah，that's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.83,0:19:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，he's got some skills。Mm - hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.09,0:19:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,And he's crazy as hell，I'm telling ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.13,0:19:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,In a good way though。He's the man for the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.17,0:19:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's got quite a record，including three years upstate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.18,0:19:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Says here he's on house arrest now。Can't go more than 100 yards from his home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.77,0:20:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Roman pearce.！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.97,0:20:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoo-hoo！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.89,0:20:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,He always said he'd be famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.33,0:20:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,pearce.！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.99,0:20:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Roman pearce！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.90,0:20:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yo，whatever happens next，just let it go。- I ain't in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.27,0:20:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rome！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.31,0:20:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only my homeboys call me Rome，pig！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.59,0:21:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm not a cop anymore，bro。- Is that true？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.42,0:21:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Blondie here's not a cop anymore？- That's true。No badge.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.11,0:21:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoo！Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.89,0:21:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,You still fight like shit。You still fight like shit
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.42,0:21:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,You better chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.53,0:21:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What the hell are you doin' here，O'Conner？- I'll choke you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.33,0:21:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you to stay away from
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.57,0:21:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You should've told me。- I did three years，Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.91,0:21:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you it wasn't my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.62,0:22:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why did you come here，O'Conner？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.52,0:22:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got a deal for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.06,0:22:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,When I needed your ass，you were nowhere to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.83,0:22:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now you tryin' to hand out deals？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.71,0:22:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need you to come to Miami and drive with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.34,0:22:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you do，they'll take off that anklet and they'll clear your entire record.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.78,0:22:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I did three years in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.91,0:22:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Three years in jail off you，Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.05,0:22:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know you better than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.45,0:22:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe you don't。Maybe you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.09,0:22:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,You guys finished？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.66,0:22:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,This deal legit？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.79,0:22:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's right，if you do this job for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.66,0:22:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Told you。- Shut up，punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.73,0:22:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,So you gonna clean my record and get this thing off my ankle？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.70,0:23:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's right。I thought you couldn't wander more than 100 yards from your home.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.91,0:23:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why do you think I'm parked so close to the derby？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.48,0:23:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man，quit playin' like you gonna pass this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.55,0:23:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait。Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.42,0:23:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，bro，what's going on？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.89,0:23:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know if I should be trusting you，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.83,0:23:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just think of it this way。It's an opportunity for a fresh start.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.03,0:23:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Let's just go do this。- I wouldn't need a fresh start…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.63,0:24:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- if it weren't for you。- Man，you been using that since the day you got busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.07,0:24:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Now，let's just chill out and go do this。- I don't need to chill out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.91,0:24:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，you do。And you need to stop blaming me for your every mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.24,0:24:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,And Roman pearce needs to start taking responsibility for his own actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.61,0:24:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You need to go to hell。- And you need to go back to Barstow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.92,0:24:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not goin' back to Barstow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.50,0:24:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brian O'Conner，Roman pearce，meet Monica Fuentes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.30,0:24:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Do they have background on Verone？- They've been briefed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.97,0:24:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good。All right，here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.51,0:24:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Verone's looking for drivers。I've arranged for both of you to join up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.58,0:24:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've also hired some thugs。You know，to make it legit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.18,0:24:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- When do we start？- Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.58,0:24:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are we drivin'？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.82,0:24:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoo-hoo-hoo-hoo！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.59,0:25:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't even think about takin' the convertible.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.59,0:25:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,It might loosen your mousse.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.80,0:25:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，that's cool。That's too much chrome for me anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.60,0:25:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn！Where you all confiscate these rims from，man？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.27,0:25:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Check in with us after you meet him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.64,0:25:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You gonna have any problems with these two knuckleheads？- I can handle 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.78,0:25:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They give you any trouble at all，you let me know。- Thanks，Markham.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.32,0:25:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll ride with you，cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.79,0:25:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Why she gotta ride with you。- You get the convertible。Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.07,0:25:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Turn right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.98,0:25:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- So you used to be a cop？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.45,0:25:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,How long you been under？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.45,0:25:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I lost track.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.99,0:26:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,You all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.29,0:26:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,You might wanna keep your eyes on the road，playboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.46,0:26:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What，you think we're gonna crash？- I haven't decided yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.60,0:26:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doin'，Brian？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.98,0:26:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,He did the 「」stare and drive「 on you，didn't he？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.42,0:26:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,He got that from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.48,0:27:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Once we get in here，you're on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.87,0:27:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.63,0:27:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，where did you get them cars，the bottom of a cereal box？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.47,0:27:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Eh！Real funny，Fonzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.71,0:27:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.38,0:27:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Roberto，Enrique，I need pictures of the drivers，
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.25,0:27:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,their license plates，their cars，and anything else you can find.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.05,0:27:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,[Spanish]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.70,0:27:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.33,0:27:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep your mouth shut and follow my lead，all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.30,0:28:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I got this。- No，I'm serious now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.74,0:28:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Handle your business。I'll handle mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.74,0:28:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,[Spanish]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.78,0:28:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch your hands，brah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.62,0:28:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go in line。Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.40,0:28:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Carter.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.34,0:28:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Drivers are here。- Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.58,0:28:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.08,0:28:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Stay。- [Spanish]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.65,0:28:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming on such short notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.42,0:28:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,My red Ferrari was confiscated yesterday，and it sits in an impound lot in Little Haiti.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.26,0:28:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's about 20 miles from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.43,0:29:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,The car isn't important。What is important is the package I left in the glove box.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.00,0:29:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,The first team back here with the package will have an opportunity to work for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.94,0:29:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What，we gotta audition？- Nobody's got a gun to your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.95,0:29:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.15,0:29:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Driver's licenses。pass 'em up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.12,0:29:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Before Christmas，guys。- [Spanish] Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.32,0:29:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Go！Go，man。- Come on。Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.68,0:29:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，cuz.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.65,0:29:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，let's see what this thing can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.20,0:30:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Agent Markham，I've got 'em heading south on I-95.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.01,0:30:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.01,0:30:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're running。What a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.75,0:30:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Stick with me，Rome。What you got？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.16,0:30:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why must I chase the cat？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.25,0:30:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Smart ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.55,0:31:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah？You think you're the bomb，Rome？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.46,0:31:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's see if you still got it，Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.23,0:31:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，Rome。I got somethin' for your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.58,0:31:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch this，bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.19,0:32:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.29,0:32:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，Rome。How do you like them apples？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.69,0:32:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Show off.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.33,0:32:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's the Brian O'Conner school of driving right there，baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.17,0:32:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crazy-ass white boy！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.10,0:32:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.70,0:32:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey，man。- Huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.00,0:32:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get yourself on outta the street.！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.57,0:33:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boy，that's some bad shit，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.25,0:33:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do we got？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.59,0:33:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's good。Show me his partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.56,0:33:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cars。Cars。Where are the cars？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.67,0:33:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stinkin' boats。Where are the cars？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.45,0:33:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need the cars。Where are the cars at？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.21,0:34:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Look in the center。Look in the center。- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.15,0:34:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Chi-ching！Now put your blouse back on。- Hater.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.00,0:34:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit.！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.90,0:34:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Don't let 'em get away。- Not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.01,0:34:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sit on it，Fonzie！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.74,0:34:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the hell？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.24,0:34:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aw，shit！Cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.25,0:34:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What the hell they doin' here？- Rome，no.！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.82,0:34:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.79,0:35:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Son of a bitch！- Juvie record for popping cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.90,0:35:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Two years in J.D.，then another year for aiding and abetting an armed robbery.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.83,0:35:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's clean。Dirty but clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.80,0:35:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hm。All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.29,0:35:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，man，you got somethin'to eat up in there？We hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.84,0:35:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sit 'em by the pool。Mm - hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.51,0:35:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.35,0:35:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hmm。What you checking her out for？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.15,0:36:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not checking her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.82,0:36:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes，you were。- No，I wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.89,0:36:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I seen you checkin' her out，man。- Okay，I was。Now shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.60,0:36:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You shut up。- Don't tell me to shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.17,0:36:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Both you girlies shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.27,0:36:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.71,0:36:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.38,0:36:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,You sure are cozy in this big ol' mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.45,0:36:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sleepin' with the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.56,0:36:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no。Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.86,0:36:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice Ferrari you got in the driveway.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.70,0:36:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm glad you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.77,0:36:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Darlin'，will you hold that？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.88,0:37:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,We did all that for a damn cigar？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.82,0:37:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，you did that for a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.13,0:37:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you really think that I would let somebody impound my car？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.17,0:37:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,The boatyard's mine。Oh，by the way，
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.94,0:37:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,you two owe me a gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.64,0:37:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I'll just take it off your cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.11,0:37:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Off our cut。Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.32,0:37:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I like that。- Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.79,0:37:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's this job you got for us anyway？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.79,0:37:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.66,0:37:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,The house has ears in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.56,0:37:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have something I want you to carry from North Beach to the Keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.03,0:37:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What is it？- Just put in the car what I tell you to，
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.23,0:37:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,drive it to me and don't let anyone stop you，understand？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.00,0:38:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。Any chance of cop trouble？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.74,0:38:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。I'm buying you a window of time，but it's not gonna be open very long.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.55,0:38:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,You make it，
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.25,0:38:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,and I'll personally hand you 100 G's at the finish line.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.15,0:38:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Make it 100 G's a piece，papi.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.56,0:38:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，man，obviously，
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.36,0:38:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- your pockets ain't nervous。- Hey，hey，hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.36,0:38:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't ever touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.90,0:38:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ours are empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.17,0:38:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like I said，we hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.08,0:38:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.72,0:38:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why don't you two boys join us at the club a little later tonight？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.39,0:38:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah。pearl at midnight？- We'll get to know each other a little better.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.09,0:38:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.33,0:38:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We'll see you tonight。- See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.60,0:39:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，you！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.70,0:39:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your pockets aren't empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.11,0:39:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Damn。- I'll take my cutter back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.92,0:39:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stupid ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.12,0:39:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，man，I figured you had，like，12 or 13.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.42,0:39:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not too bright，are you？Just get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.39,0:39:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Same old Rome doin' the same old stupid shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.96,0:39:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Get off me，man。- What，runnin' your mouth？Insultin' people？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.93,0:39:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stealin' Verone's shit？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.93,0:39:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Think I'm gonna let somebody stare me down？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.24,0:39:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't let nobody stare me down in jail，homeboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.17,0:39:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Think I'm gonna let it fly on a beach？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.38,0:39:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you，I'll take my cutter back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.28,0:39:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,His rich ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.41,0:39:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And you're packin'！- Like you ain't？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.62,0:39:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.62,0:39:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- From here，I do the talkin'。- Looks like you wanna do a little more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.39,0:40:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，and what's that supposed to mean？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.39,0:40:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,It means you always gettin' in trouble over a female，Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.44,0:40:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man，Tej's garage is ridiculous。He's got the best of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.54,0:40:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Snap-on tools。All these lifts are brand-new。They're only maybe a couple months old.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.05,0:40:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，yo，Jimmy。What's up，man？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.02,0:40:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What up，Bullet？- That's Rome right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.02,0:40:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,When you get a second，I want you to check out…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.26,0:40:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,the Evo and the Spyder and make sure everything's copecetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.62,0:40:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Evo？Where'd you get an Evo from？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.63,0:40:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Well，it's a long story。- I got you，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.96,0:40:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- All right，thanks，Jimmy。- Come check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.96,0:40:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's so hot and humid out here，I can't even wear no drawers.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.93,0:40:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah，tell me about it。- Look at all this potential out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.01,0:40:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't do that，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.85,0:40:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.16,0:41:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn。Baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.66,0:41:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Girl，you know your boy can help you put that fire out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.60,0:41:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at the bubble on that
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.97,0:41:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That's cool。- That's serious right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.37,0:41:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're making me lose money。Don't do that to me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.47,0:41:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,I cannot take that right Come on，Ray！Do it！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.71,0:41:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Tej parker，
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.88,0:41:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Roman pearce.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.55,0:41:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on，baby - Basically，he's the man to know in Miami.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.55,0:41:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's got his finger in absolutely everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.68,0:41:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just the way it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.69,0:41:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's goin' on，Suki？- What's up，baby？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.69,0:41:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How you doing？- I'm good。How you doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.92,0:41:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's this？What's the latest？- It's a work in progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.06,0:41:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's not finished yet。- That's some artistic shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.76,0:41:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You got talent，girl。- Yeah，she's good。She's the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.53,0:41:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do or die。Bring it home，Ray。Bring it home，Ray。Bring it home。Bring it home.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.57,0:41:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，baby！pay up！pay up！pay up！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.27,0:41:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's how they do it out here，man？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.58,0:42:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Every day。- That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.08,0:42:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right here，right now。What's up，man？You don't look too happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.98,0:42:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,A'ight？Expeditiously，man。I need it quick right here。What's up？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.69,0:42:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you。Thank you。All right。How you feeling？A'ight？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.49,0:42:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- A'ight。Thank you。- Thank you，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.59,0:42:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Not too bad。- Whoo！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.16,0:42:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll see you about your money，homey。You race too？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.20,0:42:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.37,0:42:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hit a wall doin'，like，a buck 20 couple years ago，you know？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.81,0:42:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ever since then，I just been organizing and collecting，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.51,0:42:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tej，check it out。He's gonna be in town for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.31,0:42:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is there anyway he could use that cot？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.05,0:42:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's wrong with your place，man？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.05,0:42:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I don't wanna stay with him。He got bad habits.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.22,0:42:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,A'ight，man。Whatever，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.82,0:42:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Show him around real quick，a'ight？I'll be up there in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.59,0:42:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.23,0:42:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,A'ight，who want a chance to win their money back？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.73,0:42:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's up，Jimmy？So you ever seen anything like this before？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.27,0:42:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。Both of them are wired up like I never seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.44,0:43:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？- Yeah，man。They got us wired with G.P.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.58,0:43:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's why Markham knew we were gonna be at that impound lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.61,0:43:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yo，you the master mechanic。Why don't you just yank that shit up out of there？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.92,0:43:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll try，but this ain't LoJack.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.32,0:43:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,The D.I.S。box，the engine management system，hell，the main harness
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.86,0:43:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,The G.P.S。is spidered into all of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.86,0:43:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，tell me somethin'，man。Do I even want to know where the Skyline is，dawg？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.86,0:43:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or where you been the past couple of days？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.93,0:43:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Or where the hell you got these rides from？- They're hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.47,0:43:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，they hot。They wired so hot that whoever's trackin' these things will know…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.00,0:43:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,every time you don't wear your seat belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.44,0:43:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，Jimmy，just do what you can do，bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.71,0:43:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I got ya。- Thanks，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.11,0:43:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man，we need to get these on the street ASAp.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.15,0:43:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，bro，check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.15,0:43:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see that Cadillac across the street over there？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.06,0:43:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah。- Yeah，well，they've been on us since we left Verone's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.34,0:44:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,[Spanish]
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.04,0:44:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,[Spanish]
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.48,0:44:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，man，I'll clean your windshield for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.51,0:44:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doin'，man？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.75,0:44:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,[Spanish]
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.22,0:44:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everything's copecetic，homey。[Spanish]
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.86,0:44:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kiss my ass，putos.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.76,0:44:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.26,0:44:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go！Let's go！Let's go！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.37,0:44:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,[Spanish]
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.24,0:44:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's gonna blow our cover before we even get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.21,0:44:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey，Bilkins，can you tell me what went wrong？- That's what I wanna know.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.64,0:44:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Show me your hands！Come on。Keep 'em up！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.78,0:44:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's this about，man？- Hey，w-what's goin' on？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.71,0:44:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold this。You think you can shoot at me？I'm a goddamn federal agent！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.62,0:44:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you talkin' about？Get your damn hands off me！Get him away from me！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.75,0:44:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just 'cause you wear a badge don't mean you can come in and mess shit up.！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.19,0:45:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Get your hands off of me！- You're lucky I didn't shoot you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.03,0:45:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Shut up，Rome！- Don't tell me to shut up，Brian！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.73,0:45:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,You almost blew our cover，old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.60,0:45:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You shouldn't have shown up like you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.07,0:45:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,What，you didn't know Verone was testing us？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.27,0:45:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No。I thought you punks were running。- Running！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.64,0:45:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's great。That's real great！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.71,0:45:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，and if Rome wanted to shoot you，you wouldn't be here right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.11,0:45:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。We gotta get this under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.95,0:45:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，that's mine.！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.45,0:45:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- So？- So tell me what you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.39,0:45:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，Rome and I will be making a run for Verone.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.06,0:45:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not sure when and where。But he did say he bought us a window.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.73,0:45:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm assuming from the local cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.37,0:45:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can talk to some of the guys at the local p.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.37,0:45:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。No good。If Verone's got some of them on the payroll，
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.57,0:45:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,then we can't let them know our operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.67,0:45:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Exactly。In addition，
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.21,0:45:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Verone told us that he himself would be waiting at the drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.95,0:45:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's good news。If you're gonna be delivering drug money to him，
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.42,0:46:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- then we can get him for laundering。- No，there's only one problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.12,0:46:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's that？- Fuentes Verone's tappin' her.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.99,0:46:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Tappin' her？Tappin' her how？- That is crap！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.26,0:46:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,What you talkin' about，homeboy？We know what we seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.76,0:46:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you think，O'Conner？You think she's compromised？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.67,0:46:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You should know。- What's that supposed to mean？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.44,0:46:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？You mean your old pal O'Conner didn't tell ya？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.44,0:46:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,He flipped on Bilkins in L.A。Gave his mark his car keys and let him disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.21,0:46:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's why he's not a cop anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.15,0:46:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,So what do you think，expert？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.02,0:46:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man，I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.02,0:46:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。We'll keep an eye on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.02,0:46:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.57,0:46:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You let your man go，huh？- Drop it。I don't wanna talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.60,0:46:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drop it，hell！I wanna hear about this，homey.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.81,0:46:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I said forget about it，cuz.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.41,0:47:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got Fuentes in with Verone，Markham tryin' to blow our cover…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.58,0:47:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,and we got two wired cars that are no better than that damn ankle bracelet of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.82,0:47:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm-a tell you，brah。You let your man Markham do that shit again in front of Verone，
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.85,0:47:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- that's gonna be our ass。- I know，man。I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.42,0:47:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's gettin' thick real quick，and we may need a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.26,0:47:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We gotta come up with some exit strategy。- Exit strategy，huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.93,0:47:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.20,0:47:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I like the way that sounds。What you got in mind？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.60,0:47:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know，man。But we need two more cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.18,0:47:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.53,0:47:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fonzie and Fabio。Glad you can join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.44,0:48:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,We heard you boys wanted to get rid of those CrackerJack toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.37,0:48:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。Actually we just figured those cars you got deserved better drivers，
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.38,0:48:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,which is why we're gonna take 'em off your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.71,0:48:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You know，why don't we settle this now？- Wait，wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.08,0:48:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,How about we settle this on the blacktop，huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.42,0:48:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Each car does it down and back，tag-team style
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.89,0:48:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- for slips。- Loser walks home.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.09,0:48:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We came to race。- Well，load 'em up then.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.56,0:48:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，bro。Let's get these cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.30,0:48:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，check it out。There's no way we gonna beat these guys straight up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.94,0:48:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Hemi's puttin' out about 425…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.37,0:48:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,and that Yenko will snap a speed on about five seconds flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.14,0:48:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're gonna have to pull somethin' out of our ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.55,0:48:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,The only thing I can think of is save the spray for the way back，the return trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.68,0:48:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Done deal。- All right。Let's do this，bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.15,0:48:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gettin' that orange one.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.25,0:48:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,You ain't ready，Fabio！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.76,0:49:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。You each got a barrel to go around down at the end of the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.63,0:49:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,The second wave gotta sit tight till your partner crosses this line right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.47,0:49:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,First team to go down and back twice wins the race.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.54,0:49:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,At which point，
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.71,0:49:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,the losers will hand over them keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.45,0:49:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Otherwise，you'll be eatin' breakfast through straws from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.62,0:49:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Comprende？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.22,0:49:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.16,0:49:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，this means you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.89,0:49:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I got it。- A'ight.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.53,0:49:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's race.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.57,0:49:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，baby.！You got this，Rome。Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.00,0:49:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，you gone，homey。I got this。This is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.48,0:49:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,You about to lose your car.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.98,0:49:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Do it，Rome！- Come on。You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.81,0:49:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,You think I'm worried about this fool，man？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.68,0:49:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is nothin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.66,0:50:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Aw，no。- American muscle.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.53,0:50:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your engine ain't as big as your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.54,0:50:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gotta smoke 'em。Gotta smoke 'em。Gotta smoke 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.51,0:50:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- All right，here we go。- It's all right，baby。I'm gonna handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.65,0:50:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.75,0:50:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ready and… go！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.09,0:50:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,You ain't ready。I run these streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.04,0:50:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.70,0:50:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Romey Rome。You ain't heard of me？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.16,0:51:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.33,0:51:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.57,0:51:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm-a get you。Oh，I'm-a get you！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.14,0:51:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where's your big mouth now，boy？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.11,0:51:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,That car's going home with me，homey.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.29,0:51:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit。Eat this，sucker！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.64,0:51:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.04,0:52:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，boy！Go，Korpi！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.88,0:52:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry，blondie。How does that dust taste？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.45,0:52:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.52,0:52:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.52,0:52:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the Good move，kid。Let's see if you got the balls。Come on！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.84,0:53:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoo！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.45,0:53:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Goddamn！Come on！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.46,0:53:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Brian。Bring it home，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.30,0:54:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Got two new cars！That's all my man！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.34,0:54:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.15,0:54:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Y'all ain't ready，homeboy。Get to walkin'，Fabio.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.49,0:54:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Use them bus tokens，partner.！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.83,0:54:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，how you doin'？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.37,0:54:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Good。What you need？- We're guests of Mr。Verone's.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.94,0:54:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's a 「」hoasis「 in here，brah。- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.02,0:54:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Lots of potential。- Damn。You got a pen？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.52,0:54:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Phew。It's about to get serious，brah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.89,0:55:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at that girl on the swing right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.36,0:55:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey。You guys did something right.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.43,0:55:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Verone never socializes with hired help。- Then what's that make you？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.90,0:55:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where's he at？- He's on his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.57,0:55:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You and Verone don't go everywhere together？- What's that supposed to mean？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.24,0:55:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.61,0:55:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Huh。I'm-a go take a piss.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.11,0:55:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You go do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.32,0:55:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What is his deal？- He doesn't trust people that carry badges.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.72,0:55:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,So you talk like you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.49,0:55:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。I'd been a cop about two months…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.70,0:55:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,when Roman was busted in a garage raid.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.07,0:55:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,He had eight sets of wheels in his possession，each and every one of them hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.67,0:55:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- So you busted him？- No。I didn't even know what was goin' down.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.87,0:55:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,But，uh，that doesn't really matter to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.84,0:55:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Basically，once I became a cop，
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.41,0:55:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Roman started seeing me as a friend that became the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.75,0:56:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have a little
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.39,0:56:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is there anything I can get for you，Mr。Verone？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.13,0:56:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just tell 'em to comejoin me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.47,0:56:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah。I was admiring this.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.54,0:56:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I was looking at it earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.55,0:56:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Damn。- I wasn't about to give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.92,0:56:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's up？- He's here，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.09,0:56:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where's he at？- He's over there。Don't look.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.39,0:56:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me。Mr。Verone would like for you to join him.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.16,0:56:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.23,0:56:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,See what I'm talkin' about？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.80,0:56:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's all right。Let 'em in.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.24,0:57:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go sit down。I'll talk to you in a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.61,0:57:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How ya doin'？- Good。You enjoying your night？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.81,0:57:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah。I'm havin' a good time。- Good，good.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.52,0:57:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's beautiful，isn't she？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.09,0:57:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hmm？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.76,0:57:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.14,0:57:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got balls，kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.84,0:57:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.38,0:57:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Women are a very powerful force.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.21,0:57:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see the blond sitting with the gentleman right here？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.12,0:57:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Five minutes of her time，and she can get anything she wants from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.83,0:57:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I love your hair。- Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.74,0:57:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wonder where they're going。Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.81,0:58:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，you，uh，lit my man's car on fire。Is that right？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.01,0:58:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.32,0:58:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see，I got a problem with authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.72,0:58:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hmm。I have that same problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.16,0:58:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,For me，it's cops in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.44,0:58:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Let's take a walk。Come on。- We just got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.18,0:58:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now we're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.25,0:58:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.59,0:58:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.31,0:59:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's all that？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.39,0:59:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're gonna have a little fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.89,0:59:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hmm。- Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.53,0:59:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's just stay a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.44,0:59:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Carter.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.57,0:59:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Meet，uh，Detective Whitworth.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.24,0:59:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,One of Miami's finest。Thank you，sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.88,0:59:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Are you enjoying yourself，Detective？- Yeah。I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.89,0:59:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，you know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.62,0:59:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I do know you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.66,1:00:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You been on my payroll a long time。- Verone，that ain't right.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.10,1:00:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.10,1:00:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got one last job for you，Detective。You hear me？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.30,1:00:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Look，we've been all through this。- Yeah？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.37,1:00:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。I said I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.41,1:00:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hmm。That's the wrong answer。The table.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.55,1:00:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm a detective，Verone！You do anything to me，
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.89,1:00:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,the whole force is gonna be on your ass in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.22,1:00:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth！You fat piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.79,1:00:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can stop right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.57,1:00:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What the hell What the hell is that？- Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.31,1:00:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're gonna regret this。Just stop right now！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.74,1:00:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Once the bucket gets hot enough，Detective，
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.98,1:00:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,the rat is gonna want out.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.38,1:00:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.22,1:01:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,And the only direction it can go is south.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.42,1:01:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！Get Hey！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.39,1:01:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold that.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.26,1:01:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Get it off me！I'll forget it ever happened。- Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.53,1:01:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you know that your average rat…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.03,1:01:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,can chew through a steel drain pipe？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.10,1:01:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see，you have nothing to worry about when he's screaming，Detective.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.57,1:01:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's when he goes quiet that he goes to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.71,1:01:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop it.！Stop it.！Stop it.！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.54,1:01:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid。Stop it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.95,1:01:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're in charge of the units that are watching my properties，huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.85,1:01:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,What I want is，I want a 15-minute window…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.29,1:01:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,where everybody and I mean everybody disappears.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.79,1:01:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You hear me？- I can't do it！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.96,1:01:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Stop it。I can't do it。Help.！- Okay。Monica，come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.80,1:01:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Help.！Help.！- Shut him up。Shut him up.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.27,1:01:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help！Help！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.37,1:01:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help.！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.31,1:01:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help！Help！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.14,1:02:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's biting me！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.91,1:02:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Help.！Help.！- What？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.45,1:02:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got somethin' you wanna say？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.89,1:02:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,He bit me！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.56,1:02:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes，I'll do it.！- Do what？Say it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.89,1:02:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll do it。I'll give you your window.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.16,1:02:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just get it off me！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.93,1:02:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get it off.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.40,1:02:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,You betray me，
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.91,1:02:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,and my rat here…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.64,1:02:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,is gonna visit your wife，Lynn yeah
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.94,1:02:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,your son，Clay，and your daughter，Lexi.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.41,1:02:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you hear me？You understand me？Huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.28,1:02:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You hear me？- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.09,1:02:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll burn your… eyes out！I'll burn 'em out！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.52,1:02:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get it off me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.62,1:02:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Good。Now you can go。- Get it off me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.70,1:02:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Get rid ofhim。Let's go。- Get if off.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.47,1:03:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mm。You boys enjoy the show？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.48,1:03:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fifteen minutes，and then every cop in Florida is gonna be on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.71,1:03:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Be at Versailles Cafe，6：00 a.m.，day after tomorrow，ready to drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.65,1:03:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You understand？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.85,1:03:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't play games with me，or you'll be next。All right？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.99,1:03:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help yourself to a little champagne。Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.30,1:03:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was a damn rat，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.30,1:03:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.14,1:03:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,You ever… touch another man again，and I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.95,1:03:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,You hear me？Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.25,1:03:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,You hear me？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.99,1:03:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,She was into it，man。What's that about？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.13,1:04:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you seen the way she grabbed the dude's head.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.73,1:04:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,She had to，man。He was testing her。You gotta remember，
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.57,1:04:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,her ass is on the line，just like ours.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.24,1:04:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,You feelin' this girl way too much.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.34,1:04:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,She just like that crazy-ass trailer-raff from back-in-the-day，Tonya.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.14,1:04:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tonya？Man，you went out with her after I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.58,1:04:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，I couldn't let her go to waste.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.78,1:04:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got you，I got you，I got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.92,1:04:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Is that right？- See，we can race for cash，
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.96,1:04:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,but when I step on the gas，my nitrous go blast，leave your ass in the past.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.13,1:04:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And，Tej，you about to lose your garage。- Whatever，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.80,1:04:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm a low-budget mechanic，but I overcharge.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.97,1:04:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pay me！Let's go，man！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.04,1:04:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pay me my money。I told you，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.10,1:04:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You a happy man。I'm so glad.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.17,1:04:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is my garage，boy。Royal flush！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.34,1:04:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Give me this，man。- Holler，huh！Yes！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.48,1:04:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Did I talk to him？Talk to him。- Damn.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.11,1:04:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't play a player。put that money back on the table。You know it's my next hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.92,1:04:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jimmy，how you gonna pay me back if you keep losing to Tej？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.75,1:04:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,How ya doin'，bro？I'm gonna crash，Tej.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.89,1:04:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'll catch you tomorrow。- A'ight，boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.07,1:05:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What are you doin' here？- Brian，they're gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.14,1:05:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I heard him telling Enrique and Roberto.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.65,1:05:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Once you finish the run，they're putting a bullet in your head.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.48,1:05:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You sure you heard 'em right？- I'm sure。I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.26,1:05:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Verone's boys is outs
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.50,1:05:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，I see what they lookin'for your little girlfriend here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.31,1:05:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They don't know I'm here。I snuck out。- What are they doin' here then？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.21,1:05:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I don't know。Maybe they're guessing。- Hey，go stall them.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.48,1:05:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Go stall them for two minutes。- Check her，homey。Check her.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.69,1:06:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Find what you was lookin' for？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.33,1:06:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，buddy。Hi，guys。How ya doin'？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.33,1:06:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，man，y'all still mad about y'all car？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.07,1:06:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't even trip，homey。Come on，man。You can't take a joke？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.20,1:06:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brian，this isn't about being a good cop anymore or-or doing your job.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.91,1:06:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're gonna kill you。You guys gotta pull out.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.04,1:06:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Verone pay y'all to keep a straight face like that？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.25,1:06:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,'Cause if I was makin'money，shit，I'd get that mole removed off my damn nose.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.32,1:06:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Okay？Okay。- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.72,1:06:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,How much he pay y'all anyway？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.82,1:06:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Every time I see y'all，man，y'all got the silk shirts on，
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.39,1:06:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,jewelry，you know，lookin'real Miami.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.23,1:06:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know？I caught you walkin' up in the club，
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.63,1:06:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,you got the hamburger meat all hangin' out，you know？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.03,1:06:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't make that run，Brian。Don't make that run.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.00,1:06:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.07,1:06:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,[Spanish]
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.84,1:07:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- [Spanish] - You ain't comin' on my
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.81,1:07:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,[Spanish]
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.29,1:07:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey，hey！Where you goin'？- You stay right here with us，buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.10,1:07:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't even think about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.88,1:07:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- [Spanish] - Stay your ass off my homeboy's boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.95,1:07:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,put the gun down！put the gun down now！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.59,1:07:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,You first，asshole！You first！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.76,1:07:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll shoot the shit outta him！put the gun down！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.16,1:07:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,[Spanish]
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.16,1:07:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,[Spanish]
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.97,1:07:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- put down the gun now！- [Spanish]
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.07,1:07:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- [Spanish] - put down the gun！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.77,1:08:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.84,1:08:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Enough。Shut up。- [Spanish]
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.91,1:08:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shut up。It's over。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.78,1:08:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's over。Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.15,1:08:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's have the gun。Come on。Let's go。Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.29,1:08:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm glad to see you boys are getting along so well.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.63,1:08:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because tomorrow，Roberto and Enrique…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.73,1:08:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,are gonna be riding along with you…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.80,1:08:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,just so that we don't have any problems.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.93,1:08:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll see you guys in a bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.87,1:08:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the hell was she doin' in there，man？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.79,1:08:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where'd you go this morning？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.42,1:08:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I went to breakfast with some friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.40,1:09:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,With friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.67,1:09:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I do have friends，Carter.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.84,1:09:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.56,1:09:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Nice shirt，Bilkins。- It's my day off.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.56,1:09:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。Well，anyhow，this is the deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.16,1:09:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Last night，Verone threatened a cop into giving us a window.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.30,1:09:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're driving to an airstrip，in the Keys，off of Nallwood Avenue.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.27,1:09:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Verone has a plane there，and he's taking off for good.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.81,1:09:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Wait a minute。How do you know this？- Monica.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.74,1:09:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's doin' her job。She warned us.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.41,1:09:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- She warned you about what？- Verone plans to kill us after we give him the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.22,1:09:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Driving into an ambush was never part of the deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.09,1:09:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm calling this off。- Like hell you are。This is a Customs case，Bilkins.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.72,1:10:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,No one's calling this off unless I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.66,1:10:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look。This is real simple.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.03,1:10:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,You make the run。You get Verone and his cash together…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.13,1:10:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,so I can move in for the bust.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.13,1:10:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right？You don't，I will find enough charges on both of you to make you disappear.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.54,1:10:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take these。We're gonna have G.p.S。on you the whole time…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.54,1:10:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,to make sure you don't get any cute ideas.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.61,1:10:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And to make sure nothing happens to them，right？- Yeah，right.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.29,1:10:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The guy's a dick，man。- Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.16,1:10:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me get this right.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.43,1:10:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,If we don't do this，then we go to jail.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.50,1:10:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,But if we do it，then Verone's gonna kill us.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.57,1:10:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a hell of a deal，huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.80,1:10:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。Maybe it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.11,1:10:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I know this guy's got an ass full of loot…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.18,1:10:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,that he's ready to dump in our cars.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.91,1:10:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I can think of two reasons why Verone doesn't need that money anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.95,1:11:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ah，here we go。- You and me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.69,1:11:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just like the old days。What do you think？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.96,1:11:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think they messed with the wrong two guys。That's what I think.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.30,1:11:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yo，Tej。What's up，bro？- What up？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.60,1:11:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，man，how quickly can you organize？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.80,1:11:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，folk，if y'all really wanna carry out this plan，
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.04,1:11:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,it's definitely the best place to do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.60,1:11:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What do y'all think，man？- I think it's perfect。What do they store here？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.30,1:11:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，man，this thing's clean.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.70,1:11:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Slank that fitted on Came to get it on Hey，Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.77,1:11:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah。What up？- We have any half-empty bottles of nitrous laying around？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.17,1:11:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sure，but I already loaded you for spray.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.81,1:11:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。I'm thinkin' we may need it for somethin' else，
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.11,1:12:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,'cause our cars may get a little crowded，you know？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.35,1:12:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man，when you start eatin' so much？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.26,1:12:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was in jail，brah.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.46,1:12:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know how shitty the grub is on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.83,1:12:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,With the way things is shapin' up out here right now，
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.40,1:12:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,it'll be a matter of time before I'm back in there or dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.77,1:12:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,So I'm tryin' to eat all I can while I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.44,1:12:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,plus the doctor tell me I got a high metabolism.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.05,1:12:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man，you remember us growing up？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.12,1:12:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，playing football in the dirt.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.19,1:12:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，gettin' in trouble，all the stupid things we did.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.53,1:12:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,When you got busted，you know，whether I was a cop or not，
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.96,1:12:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,you know，if there was anything I could've done，
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.07,1:12:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I would've done it，and I just want you to know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.30,1:13:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that why you let that dude go in L.A.？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.81,1:13:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。I think that had a lot to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.98,1:13:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,When I got busted，it wasn't your fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.78,1:13:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was all on me，Mr。Roman pearce
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.49,1:13:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,wild-and-out crazy，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.09,1:13:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,No one can tell me nothin;
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.73,1:13:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ridin' solo。- Yeah，well，not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.27,1:13:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not anymore，bro.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.63,1:14:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got Verone's Navigator leavin' the residence.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.00,1:14:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Copy。Sir，we've got Verone on the move to the airstrip.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.90,1:14:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good。Let's get a bird in the air。Tell him to keep his distance.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.34,1:14:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Good and tight。Ready to go。- Channel two。Channel two.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.61,1:14:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're all set。- Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.45,1:14:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- All set？- Yep。Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.85,1:14:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Report.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.32,1:14:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's goin'on out there？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.60,1:14:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Team one checking in。- Team two checking in.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.80,1:14:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Team three checking in。- Team four。All clear here too.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.84,1:14:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Team five checkin' in.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.90,1:14:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is team six。All clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.88,1:14:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Here we go。- Yeah，so you know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.98,1:14:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just stay cool，keep focused.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.82,1:14:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Remember，the airstrip's on Nallwood Avenue.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.19,1:14:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the third exit after the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.02,1:15:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Got it。- So what up，man？You ready for this？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.93,1:15:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，man。Guns，murderers and crooked cops？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.30,1:15:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was made for this，brah.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.07,1:15:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.82,1:16:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,[Spanish]
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.99,1:16:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got activity at Verone's trailer property.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.03,1:16:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do not move an inch until I tell you to.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.90,1:16:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,[Spanish]
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.74,1:16:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,[Spanish]
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.69,1:16:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,[Spanish]
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.86,1:16:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Load up.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.90,1:16:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,All units，move on the trailer property right now。Move！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.11,1:16:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！Local p.D。is moving in on our guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.21,1:17:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Three bags in one car，huh？- Guess so.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.06,1:17:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cops.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.33,1:17:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm not goin' back to jail。- Where you goin'，man？Let's go！Let's go！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.97,1:17:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,[Spanish] What is he doin'？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.99,1:17:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，now let's get the chopper over them。I want eyes right on top.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.50,1:17:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got it。Lima 25，follow G.P.S.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.28,1:18:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what you're doin'，man？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.28,1:18:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay with me，Rome。Stay with me。Come on，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.19,1:18:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've got 'em heading south on I-95.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.73,1:18:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bring in the aerial E.S.D.'s.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.24,1:18:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.78,1:18:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They're catching up，man！- Shut up，man！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.79,1:18:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah，nice drivin'，Rome。Nice drivin'。- I gotcha，Brian.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.47,1:19:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Check it out，man！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.35,1:19:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,What was that？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.46,1:19:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.78,1:19:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on，man。Take the wheel。- No。I can't drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.01,1:19:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Just hold the wheel！- I can't drive！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.21,1:19:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold it right there！Just hold it steady，just like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.38,1:19:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doin'，man？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.06,1:20:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Que pasa？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.20,1:20:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,[Spanish]
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.61,1:20:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoo！Yeah，man！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.29,1:21:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.13,1:21:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bilkins，the bird's in place.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.14,1:21:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。We got Verone's Navigator.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.47,1:21:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。Money's in transit。Sit tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.45,1:22:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're a good driver，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.69,1:22:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks，bro.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.26,1:22:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've got the area blocked ahead。They've got nowhere to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.97,1:22:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh！What was that？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.91,1:22:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've got a visual。Video should be coming through.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.98,1:22:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got it。Looks good.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.89,1:22:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are they going？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.20,1:22:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.84,1:23:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，Miami's finest，let's see what you got.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.91,1:23:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Stay with me，boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.21,1:23:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey，man。Everyone's here。Time for the show。- Let's give it to 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.66,1:23:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。Let the party begin。Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.28,1:23:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is unit 2599。We have the suspects surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.60,1:24:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,[Spanish]
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.47,1:24:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Holy shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.11,1:24:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a scramble，baby。A big one！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.32,1:24:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah！Let's do this！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.16,1:25:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Check this out！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.00,1:25:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're not tracking them on video.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.04,1:25:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Must have lost them in the scramble.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.97,1:25:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Y'all，let's break.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.61,1:25:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.30,1:25:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,[Spanish]
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.49,1:26:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。We got 'em going west on Beach.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.39,1:26:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Roger that。I've got 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.57,1:26:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Customs has a fix on two cars going west on Beach.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.11,1:26:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Roger。Follow those cars。- Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.97,1:26:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit。They're cornered.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.87,1:27:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,keep your hands where I can see 'em.！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.88,1:27:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- put your hands up.！- Whoa。Fellas，fellas.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.38,1:27:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know my tags are out of date，but，damn！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.59,1:27:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the hell？Where are they？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.45,1:27:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man.！How about them apples，man？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.92,1:27:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah！That's some drivin' for your ass，baby！Ain't that some drivin' for your ass？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.46,1:27:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Good job，man。- Whatever，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.69,1:27:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,You supposed to be a stone-face killer.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.76,1:27:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,You over there grabbin' your seat belt.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.83,1:27:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Tej。Thanks a lot。You're the clutch。I owe you one，big time.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.80,1:28:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，Brian，you really do owe me，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.04,1:28:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You really do Us。Suki says you owe us，a'ight？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.51,1:28:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yo，Rome。You there，man？Come in。- What's up，man？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.48,1:28:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,It looks like we got just one more trick left，huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.68,1:28:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,My pleasure，buddy。Let's do it，baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.55,1:28:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey。We should grab Verone while we still can。- No。Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.89,1:28:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？You lost 'em？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.40,1:28:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！Those little pricks are running.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.80,1:28:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's your call。What do you want to do？- We're gonna take him down.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.23,1:28:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,He is not leaving here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.30,1:28:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Enjoyin' the ride？Man，it's a fast car，huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.14,1:28:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man，it's a classic.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.04,1:28:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Old school。American muscle.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.68,1:28:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man，this car can do all kinda things，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.48,1:28:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wanna see？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.02,1:28:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Check this out right here，homey.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.02,1:28:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yo！What are you doin'，man？- Shut up！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.10,1:29:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,[Spanish]
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.90,1:29:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,It worked.！I love this button.！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.11,1:29:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay on your toes，puto！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.71,1:29:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。O'Conner，it worked，baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.45,1:29:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Blow and go。I'm all clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.52,1:29:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Meet me at the point。Hurry up，man。It's on，baby。- All right。Ten-four，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.29,1:29:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you ready？Let's go！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.03,1:29:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got this side.！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.70,1:29:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Raise your hands！Raise your hands！Raise your hands！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.07,1:29:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get down！Get down！Get down！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.14,1:29:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Clear.！We're clear.！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.74,1:29:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Back it up.！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.04,1:29:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's not Verone and Fuentes。- What do you mean？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.98,1:29:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then where the hell are they？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.92,1:30:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get off at Tarpon point.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.13,1:30:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tarpon point？There's There's no airstrip at Tarpon point.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.36,1:30:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who said anything about an airstrip？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.35,1:30:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brian。Brian，man，what's the holdup，brah？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.98,1:30:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yo，Rome，there's a new plan。- What the hell？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.65,1:30:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're meeting them at the Tarpon point exit，not the airstrip.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.26,1:30:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- So what are you sayin'？- Like I said，there's a new plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.80,1:30:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brian。Brian，hello？You there？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.03,1:30:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Damn！- Yo！What the hell is he doin'？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.47,1:30:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,The feds are in the wrong place。Brian's woman is on her own with Verone.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.11,1:30:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- So - So Brian's not comin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.49,1:31:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's all right。Let him out。- Get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.57,1:31:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,pop the trunk。[Spanish]
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.17,1:31:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.16,1:31:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where's the rest of it？- The other car.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.33,1:31:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Another car。Where's the other car？- On it's way.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.73,1:31:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- On the way，huh？- Yeah。Here's your money.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.90,1:31:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,So you know nothing about the agents that stormed my jet？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.38,1:32:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,The funny thing is that I only told one person about the airstrip.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.86,1:32:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.93,1:32:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Customs agents sure are gettin' pretty，aren't they？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.54,1:32:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Put her on the boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.31,1:32:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Let's go。- Get on the boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.96,1:32:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hide the cars and get rid of him。- Back in the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.69,1:33:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,End of the road.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.13,1:33:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，I like you，but I still gotta kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.66,1:33:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's my job.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.13,1:33:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's that？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.44,1:33:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's that？- It's Barstow，baby！It's about to get ugly！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.78,1:33:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go。Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.00,1:34:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get your Oh，shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.05,1:34:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.28,1:34:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,You had me.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.78,1:34:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,You slipped.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.02,1:34:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Eleven and a half months，and you slipped once.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.19,1:35:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,put her downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.70,1:35:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll see you in a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.87,1:35:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I thought you was dead，man。- Yeah。Me too。Thanks for saving my ass，bro.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.91,1:35:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What are you doin'，Brian？- I don't know，
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.61,1:35:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,but if Verone sees a helicopter or Customs boat，she's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.98,1:35:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boat。Car.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.88,1:35:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boat You're not gonna do what I think you're gonna do？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.05,1:35:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah，I think so。You got my back，bro？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.29,1:35:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- put on a seat belt。- Show 'em some real Dukes of Hazzard shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.33,1:35:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're gonna do this big。Hold on，Rome。Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.43,1:35:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh.！Brian，you crazy，man.！What the hell you doin'？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.77,1:35:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brian，what the hell you doin'？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.85,1:35:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.08,1:36:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.50,1:36:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,My arm。I think I broke my arm，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.81,1:36:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get the gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.33,1:36:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's over，Carter.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.58,1:37:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You okay？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.15,1:37:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm great.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.09,1:37:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got 'em，man。We got 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.66,1:37:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.05,1:37:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go！Go！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.16,1:37:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,That ought to do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.19,1:37:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，there were three bags total，huh？The three from the boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.03,1:37:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,So we good，right？My record's clean？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.30,1:38:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,You held up your end。Your records are clean.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.56,1:38:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,So maybe there was six bags.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.69,1:38:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I guess we can call it even.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.03,1:38:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Agent Dunn。- Sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.67,1:38:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,We found some more evidence.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.54,1:38:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Let's take it to the truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.75,1:38:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't drop the soap，big homey.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.18,1:38:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hope you know that when he gets out，he's gonna kill your ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.62,1:38:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,He ain't gettin' out.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.49,1:38:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'll see you soon。- You think he gonna get out？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.13,1:39:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,He'll be out.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.60,1:39:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，for real。You think he gettin' out，though？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.97,1:39:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,We took care of your decoys。They're free and clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.24,1:39:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a sedan out on the road for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.47,1:39:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Try to bring it back in one piece。- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.88,1:39:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thanks a lot，Bilkins。You're all right。- Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.31,1:39:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thanks for lookin' out，man。- All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.28,1:39:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- So you trust me now？- You a'ight.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.03,1:39:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry。Nice working with you，O'Conner.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.63,1:39:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.88,1:39:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mm。I'm-a have to stay out here in Miami，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.04,1:39:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep you out of trouble，brah.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.55,1:39:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what I'm talkin' about.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.42,1:39:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,So you gonna kick it in Miami，bro？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.49,1:40:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，man，I love Miami.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.56,1:40:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Miami's off the hook.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.29,1:40:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Open a garage together。- A garage？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.83,1:40:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,How we gonna do that，brah？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.04,1:40:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pockets ain't empty，cuz.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.98,1:40:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,And we ain't hungry no more either，brah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.00,0:01:44.19,Title,0,0,0,0,,《速度与激情2》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.10,0:00:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！走！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.06,0:01:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,唷，吉米，伙计，告诉我情况
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.87,0:01:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 告诉我都准备好了 - 我们准备好了，伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.07,0:01:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 今晚有好戏看了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.58,0:01:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，好，好 启动吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.68,0:01:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们尽情快活吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.75,0:01:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候启动你们的车啦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.45,0:01:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来吧，伙计 走
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.15,0:02:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哎哟，小妞！- 对不起！我的错！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.63,0:02:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好，姐妹们！我们是最好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.66,0:02:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是最好的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.46,0:02:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,太正点了，宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.67,0:02:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，泰 快让比赛开始吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.04,0:02:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，不，伙计 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.61,0:02:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是第一个来的，伙计 你们的第四个人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.08,0:02:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 唷，是卧金，但他要上夜班 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.98,0:02:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,上夜班？唷，为什么你不和我们比？泰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.75,0:02:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死，不，我不和你们比
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.02,0:02:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你们找到第四个人，否则就比赛就取消
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.46,0:02:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么样，哼？- 我们应该找两个…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.56,0:02:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就不必和那姑娘玩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.10,0:02:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.70,0:02:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- [西班牙语] - 喔 喔 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.64,0:02:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,何不让我找第四个人来比赛 然后在比赛中解决问题呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.51,0:03:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 带他过拉吧 - 我找任何人都行？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.78,0:03:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- [西班牙语] - 不管是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.34,0:03:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.19,0:03:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿，伙计 今晚想参加比赛吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.25,0:03:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 你知道我需要钱 - 你只有四分钟赶过来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.06,0:03:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，我就到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.09,0:03:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,比赛四分钟后开始
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.43,0:03:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，姐妹们 我们加油
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.43,0:03:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外语]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.94,0:04:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你认为你会赢？- 你怎么认为？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.77,0:04:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你最好赢 我们还需要钱付房租 - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.17,0:04:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.34,0:04:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有好车来比赛的时候我和你比
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.38,0:04:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶 我们的第四个参赛者来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.55,0:04:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 是布赖恩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.08,0:05:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶，布赖恩！我爱你，子弹！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.41,0:05:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 近来怎么样，泰？- 你在忙些什么？伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.78,0:05:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你邀请我来 - 没问题，伙计 只是，呃…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.92,0:05:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢钱别忘了我，好不？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们的口袋钱多吗？- 非常多
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.10,0:05:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好吗，舒琪？- 你好吗，子弹？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.37,0:05:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们来赌一把怎么样？- [西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.24,0:05:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人说要加大注码啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.01,0:05:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那样的话，你何不问问这里的人…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.88,0:05:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那样你就可以回家了 - 喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.55,0:05:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 嗨 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.73,0:06:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 三千五
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.16,0:06:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.00,0:06:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.41,0:06:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,三千五，哼？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.94,0:06:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也可以选择回家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.94,0:06:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.42,0:06:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 全部拿去吧 - 最好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.72,0:06:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕，舒琪 呃，要参加吗？哼？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.32,0:06:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把东西准备好我就参加
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.29,0:06:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，好的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.91,0:07:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，退后 退后 走 走
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.35,0:07:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.35,0:07:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都退后 退后 退后
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.42,0:07:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你变烤肉之前快退后
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.62,0:07:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是游戏 这是认真的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.96,0:07:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 快退后 退后 离开街道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.79,0:07:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 退后 退后
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.80,0:07:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都把眼睛放亮了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.33,0:07:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为今晚我要给你们惊喜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.67,0:07:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加油，杰克！加油，宝贝！- 我一定要赢 我一定要赢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.37,0:07:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.62,0:07:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.85,0:07:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.02,0:07:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.02,0:07:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.35,0:07:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.67,0:08:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，天啊，不
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.05,0:08:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.62,0:08:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.02,0:08:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你超不过我，笨蛋 你超不过我 来啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.46,0:08:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.87,0:09:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说你超不过我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.98,0:09:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闪开，狗娘养的！- 哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.84,0:09:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.43,0:10:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语] 唔 唔 今晚轮不到你，宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.30,0:10:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,撞你屁股，小子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.67,0:10:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的，小妞！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.49,0:10:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一轮，最后一轮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.73,0:10:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，太宽了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.17,0:10:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲刺直道，宝贝！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.05,0:10:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔-喔-喔！我们走，笨狗！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.43,0:11:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.83,0:11:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,正！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.24,0:11:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.55,0:11:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈，我就追上你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.18,0:11:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,唷，吉米，启动，伙计 按！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.89,0:11:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 你们看见了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.93,0:11:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你们，我有个惊喜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.06,0:11:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的终点怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.27,0:11:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,渡桥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.44,0:12:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦！- 喔！喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.95,0:12:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.76,0:12:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.77,0:12:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,哼？哦，天啊，不！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.04,0:13:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！爽极了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.83,0:13:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.68,0:13:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你们看到什么 子弹 和 舒琪 飞跃过渡桥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.81,0:13:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要向你们收观赏费
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.68,0:13:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把这10叠钱给他，对不？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.95,0:13:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我所说的，伙计 一起合作
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.12,0:13:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闻起来很爽，是不？- 是，这就是我想要的 给
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.69,0:13:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 你们都看到了吗？所有人好好瞧瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.16,0:13:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是所谓的相互尊敬 好，我们散场吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.50,0:13:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一场谁要赛啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.87,0:14:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.07,0:14:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，嗯，迟点你肯定要拿车去修了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.11,0:14:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以，你知道，这也许就是你们的结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.51,0:14:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心点 因为我也许会回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.72,0:14:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.85,0:14:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.62,0:14:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，你去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.36,0:14:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是时候该离开这了 - 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.29,0:14:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，天！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.13,0:15:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉萨 跟上他了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.48,0:15:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！妈的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.52,0:15:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.76,0:15:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.97,0:15:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.84,0:15:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看你的手！举起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.88,0:15:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他 我们抓到他了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.33,0:16:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在南佛罗里达待了多久了？- 一段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.80,0:16:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.87,0:16:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道你是洛杉矶特警 布赖恩 欧康纳
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.57,0:16:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们抓错人的 - 真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.35,0:16:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,过得怎么样欧康纳？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.72,0:16:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走走
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.16,0:16:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特 维安 阿根廷出生
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.06,0:16:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他大部分时间住在迈阿密
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.56,0:16:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他拥有美国最大的进出口生意
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.37,0:16:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸地，他们的企业联合 成功地把毒品运入迈阿密
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.70,0:16:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们现在很难把毒品换成现金
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.84,0:16:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经监视他一年了，但我们从未成功…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.01,0:16:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,地把他人赃并获
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.01,0:16:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们搜查过他的房子，他的仓库… - 不关紧要
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.41,0:17:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,海关已经帮了我们很大的忙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.25,0:17:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这是帮你们最后一忙的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.59,0:17:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有一个卧底…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.59,0:17:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为他打理旅行和后勤的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.89,0:17:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近，维安 要她负责找些司机
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.06,0:17:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 虽然我们现在不能确定她的身份 - 你认为她不可靠？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.26,0:17:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我的人 她没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.63,0:17:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她和 维安 一起近一年了 甚至现在和他同居了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.30,0:17:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意，是FBI的主意要把你送进去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.54,0:17:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我反对 但我们需要一些好的司机…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.98,0:17:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,令到他人赃俱获
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.28,0:17:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要和当长官合作
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.28,0:17:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我不干呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.78,0:17:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，这是你在洛杉矶违规的清单
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.62,0:17:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,教唆和支持，妨碍司法公正 你知道那刑事犯登记表
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.56,0:17:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，我们可以 为了司法的利益把这些都毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.29,0:17:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果你合作的话 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.50,0:17:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划是怎么样？当和我在街上赛车？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.57,0:17:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.08,0:18:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,当…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.22,0:18:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们要成为伙伴了，兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.22,0:18:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以马上告诉我 给我什么发动机来飚车吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.59,0:18:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,高卢 12 还是 高卢 24？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.23,0:18:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯… 24
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.90,0:18:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还不知道做比萨的地方能生产发动机
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.14,0:18:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧，伙计，别这样 我做不来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.60,0:18:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是认真的，如果你们给我这样的发动机
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.77,0:18:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真的机会不大
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.01,0:18:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找其他人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.68,0:18:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.25,0:18:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一的方法是我选人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.39,0:18:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，欧康纳，你心中有哪个人选？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.26,0:18:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,在巴斯拖 和我一起长大的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.73,0:18:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是谁？- 罗马 皮斯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.72,0:19:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！太…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.95,0:19:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这就是你蒙特卡洛的兄弟？- 是，就是他
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.83,0:19:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯，他有点料 - 唔 - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.09,0:19:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很疯狂，我告诉过你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.13,0:19:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一种想法 他适合这工作
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.17,0:19:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有不少案底，包括最近这三年
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.18,0:19:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在被软禁 不能离开他家100码
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.77,0:20:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马 皮斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.97,0:20:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔-呼！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.89,0:20:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总是说他出名了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.33,0:20:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.99,0:20:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马 皮斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.90,0:20:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 唷，不管发生什么事，别插手 - 我不插手
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.27,0:20:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.20,1:20:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.31,0:20:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我家乡的伙伴才叫我罗，猪！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.59,0:21:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不再当警察了，兄弟 - 真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.42,0:21:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你这家伙不再是警察了？- 真的 没有徽章了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.11,0:21:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.89,0:21:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是那么好战 你还是那么好战…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.42,0:21:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好认真点
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.53,0:21:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在干什么，欧康纳？- 我会掐死你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.33,0:21:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你远离…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.57,0:21:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你早应该告诉我 - 我三年前就告诉你了，布赖恩
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.91,0:21:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你那不是我的错
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.62,0:22:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么来这里，欧康纳？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.52,0:22:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来和你交易的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.06,0:22:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我需要你的时候，我却找不到你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.83,0:22:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你想来施舍我？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.71,0:22:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你和我去迈阿密和我开车
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.34,0:22:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你愿意，他们会脱下那脚镣 和清除你全部的案底
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.78,0:22:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被监禁三年了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.91,0:22:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,三年了，布赖恩
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.05,0:22:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我比你的想法更清楚明白
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.45,0:22:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你不明白 也许你不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.09,0:22:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们忙完了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.66,0:22:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个交易合法吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.79,0:22:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，如果你帮我们工作的话
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.66,0:22:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 告诉过你 - 闭嘴，小子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.73,0:22:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你们会清我的案底 和帮我把这脚镣去掉？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.70,0:23:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我想你无法远离 你房子100码的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.91,0:23:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们何不会认为 我会把车停在这铁块附近？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.48,0:23:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计，你拒绝的话就等于放弃了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.55,0:23:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.42,0:23:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，兄弟，怎么啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.89,0:23:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我是否应该信任你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.83,0:23:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样想吧 这是重新开始的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.03,0:23:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们来吧 - 我不需要新的开始…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.63,0:24:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果不是因为你 - 伙计，你怎么失败的那天起就这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.07,0:24:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如今，让我们冷静点干完这事 - 我不需要冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.91,0:24:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，你需要 你不要把你的过失都责备于我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.24,0:24:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马皮斯要开始 为自己的所作所为负责任
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.61,0:24:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去死吧 - 你需要回去 巴斯拖
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.92,0:24:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再回去 巴斯拖 的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.50,0:24:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,布赖恩 欧康纳，罗马皮斯，这是 莫尼卡 芳特斯
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.30,0:24:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们有没 维安 的后台？- 他们是自己人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.97,0:24:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 嗯，情况是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.51,0:24:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,维安在找司机 我安排你们两个加入
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.58,0:24:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也雇佣了一些其他人 你知道，令这真实点
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.18,0:24:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们什么时候开始？- 马上
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.58,0:24:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开什么车？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.82,0:24:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔-喔-喔-喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.59,0:25:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想和我换
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.59,0:25:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,只会浪费你的口水
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.80,0:25:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，这驾很酷 总之我喜欢这铬合金的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.60,0:25:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！你们这些车哪来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.27,0:25:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,试车后过来报道
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.64,0:25:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你对这两个傻瓜有意见吗？- 我能应付他们
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.78,0:25:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们给你任何麻烦都告诉我 - 谢谢，马卡姆
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.32,0:25:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搭你的车，小子
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.79,0:25:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么她坐你的车 - 你有那部车了 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.07,0:25:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这转右
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.98,0:25:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你以前是警察？- 是
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.45,0:25:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做卧底多久了？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.45,0:25:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我迷失了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.99,0:26:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.29,0:26:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧着点路吧，小子
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.46,0:26:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？你认为我们会撞车吗 - 我不能确定哦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.60,0:26:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么，布赖恩？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.98,0:26:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在表演看着你开车，是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.42,0:26:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是学我的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.48,0:27:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦我们进去，你们自己小心
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.87,0:27:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.63,0:27:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，你们这车哪来的，食品包装盒？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.47,0:27:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃！真好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.71,0:27:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.38,0:27:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伯托，艾礼馗，我需要司机的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.25,0:27:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的许可证，他们的车，还有你能找到的任何东西
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.05,0:27:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.70,0:27:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.33,0:27:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的嘴闭上，听我的，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.30,0:28:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道 - 不，我现在是认真的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.74,0:28:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己处理你的生意 我解决我自己的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.74,0:28:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.78,0:28:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心你的手，伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.62,0:28:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,排队过来 走
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.40,0:28:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.34,0:28:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 司机来了 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.58,0:28:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.08,0:28:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在这停着 - [西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.65,0:28:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们简单听我说几句
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.42,0:28:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我红色的法拉利昨天被没收了 现在放在利特尔海地
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.26,0:28:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,离这20英里的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.43,0:29:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,车不重要 重要的是我留在车上手套箱的包
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.00,0:29:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一队把包取回给我的人将 获得被我录用的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.94,0:29:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？我们要做测试？- 没人逼你干
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.95,0:29:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.15,0:29:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,驾驶证 传过来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.12,0:29:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点，伙计 - [西班牙语] 走！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.32,0:29:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走！走，伙计 - 快 走！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.68,0:29:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊，笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.65,0:29:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，让我们看看这些车能多棒
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.20,0:30:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,马卡姆长官，我看到他们往南去住I-95
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.01,0:30:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.01,0:30:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们飞住了 真是惊讶
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.75,0:30:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 跟我来，罗 你在搞什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.16,0:30:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要追猫？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.25,0:30:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,聪明的笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.55,0:31:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，耶？你以为你是炸弹，罗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.46,0:31:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看你是否还跟得上，布赖恩
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.23,0:31:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，罗 我有东西要给你看
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.58,0:31:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧这个，兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.19,0:32:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.29,0:32:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶，罗 你觉得怎么样？伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.69,0:32:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你炫
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.33,0:32:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是 布赖恩 欧康纳 驾驶学校 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.17,0:32:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯狂的白人！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.10,0:32:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，妈的！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.70,0:32:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨，伙计 - 唔？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.00,0:32:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那街上别动！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.57,0:33:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有糟糕事
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.25,0:33:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,查到什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.59,0:33:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 查查他的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.56,0:33:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,车 车 车在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.67,0:33:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是划船 车在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.45,0:33:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要车 车在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.21,0:34:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瞧那中间 瞧那中间 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.15,0:34:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找到了！穿上你的衣服吧 - 混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.00,0:34:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.90,0:34:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别让他们逃了 - 没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.01,0:34:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那坐着吧，笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.74,0:34:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.24,0:34:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，妈的！警察
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.25,0:34:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们在这里干什么？- 罗，不！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.82,0:34:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,该走了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.79,0:35:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 狗娘养的！- 玩车的失足青年
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.90,0:35:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,两年少年犯罪，一年协助和教唆持械抢劫
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.83,0:35:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是清白的 卑鄙，但清白的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.80,0:35:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 好
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.29,0:35:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，伙计，你这有吃的吗？我们饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.84,0:35:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 叫他们去泳池那坐下 - 嗯 - 哼
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.51,0:35:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 过来
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.35,0:35:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,唔 你有没查过她是干嘛的？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.15,0:36:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没查过她
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.82,0:36:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不，你有 - 不，我没有
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.89,0:36:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我认为你在查住她 - 好，我是 现在闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.60,0:36:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你闭嘴 - 别叫我闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.17,0:36:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个都闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.27,0:36:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.71,0:36:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.38,0:36:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定在这大公寓住得舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.45,0:36:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,和仇人睡在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.56,0:36:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，不，不 坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.86,0:36:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那驾法拉利很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.70,0:36:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.77,0:36:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的，拿着好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.88,0:37:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是为了拿雪茄？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.82,0:37:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，你们是为了份工
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.13,0:37:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的认为我会被人扣了车？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.17,0:37:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那船坞是我的 哦，顺便说说
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.94,0:37:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两欠我一扇门
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.64,0:37:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我会从你们的薪水扣的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.11,0:37:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,扣薪水 好
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.32,0:37:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.79,0:37:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我们干什么工作？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.79,0:37:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.66,0:37:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,屋里有窃听器
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.56,0:37:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有些东西想你帮我从 北海滩送去基士街
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.03,0:37:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是什么？- 你只管按我的指示把货放到车上
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.23,0:37:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,开过来给我，别让人拦截了，明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.00,0:38:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 有可能被警察找麻烦吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.74,0:38:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会 我会替你买通警察，但时间不会太长
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.55,0:38:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你成功的话
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.25,0:38:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会亲自给你们10万美金
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.15,0:38:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好10万元吧，老板
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.56,0:38:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧，伙计，很明显
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.36,0:38:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的口袋并不紧张 - 嗨嗨嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.36,0:38:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰我
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.90,0:38:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的却是空的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.17,0:38:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我说的，我们饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.08,0:38:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个主意
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.72,0:38:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为何不参加我们今晚的晚会？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.39,0:38:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 耶 珀尔会来？- 我们最好相互了解一下
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.09,0:38:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 听起来不错
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.33,0:38:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们今晚见 - 今晚见
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.60,0:39:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，你！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.70,0:39:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的口袋并不空
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.11,0:39:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 把我的刀拿回来
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.92,0:39:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.12,0:39:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，伙计，我以为你有十二三个…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.42,0:39:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不太醒目，是不？快走
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.39,0:39:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是以前的 罗 干着同样的蠢事
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.96,0:39:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放开我 - 你的嘴巴怎么还这样？老损人？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.93,0:39:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,还偷 维安的东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.93,0:39:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我在让人看衰我？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.24,0:39:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,在监狱我也不会让人看衰我
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.17,0:39:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我会让他指指点点？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.38,0:39:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你，把我的刀还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.28,0:39:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这富家子
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.41,0:39:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你就给脸色他看！- 你没有吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.62,0:39:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然没有
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.62,0:39:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 从现在开始，我来说话 - 你以为你会比我好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.39,0:40:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，那是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.39,0:40:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是你老因女人惹麻烦，布赖恩
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.44,0:40:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计，泰 的修车场是很棒的 他任何配件都是最好的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.54,0:40:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好的工具 全部都是新的 最久的也许也只有两个月
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.05,0:40:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，唷，吉米 怎么样？伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.02,0:40:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好，子弹 - 这是 罗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.02,0:40:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以给我点时间吗，我想你帮我检测…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.26,0:40:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那辆伊沃和斯派特，确定一切良好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.62,0:40:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊沃？你的伊沃哪来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.63,0:40:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯，说来话长 - 好，我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.96,0:40:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好，谢谢，吉米 - 过来检测一下
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.96,0:40:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这又热又潮湿，我甚至不想穿衬衣了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.93,0:40:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯，有话直说吧 - 哈哈，你瞧瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.01,0:40:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样，伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.85,0:40:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.16,0:41:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.66,0:41:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,小妞，你知道我可以让你更惹火
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.60,0:41:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧那上面的泡泡…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.97,0:41:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 酷弊了 - 在这严肃点
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.37,0:41:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我输钱啦 现在别搞我
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.47,0:41:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在赔不起啊… 加油，雷！上啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.71,0:41:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，泰帕克
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.88,0:41:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马皮斯
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.55,0:41:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加油，宝贝… - 基本上，他在迈阿密是个名人
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.55,0:41:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他什么事都搞得定
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.68,0:41:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.69,0:41:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在干什么，舒琪？- 你好吗？宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.69,0:41:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 过得怎么样？- 我很好 你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.92,0:41:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么？最近的是什么？- 只是点改进
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.06,0:41:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还没有完成 - 就像是艺术品似的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.76,0:41:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有天赋，小妞 - 是的，她很棒 她是最好的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.53,0:41:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,决一死战 坚持到底，雷 坚持到底，雷 坚持到底 坚持到底
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.57,0:41:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶，宝贝！给钱！给钱！给钱！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.27,0:41:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们什么时候来这比赛的？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.58,0:42:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 每天 - 真是疯狂
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.08,0:42:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,此时此刻 你好吗？伙计 你看起来不太开心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.98,0:42:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是？快手点，伙计 我要快点 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.69,0:42:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 谢谢 好 感觉怎么样？还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.49,0:42:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 - 谢谢 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.59,0:42:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不错嘛 - 喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.16,0:42:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,赚得不少啊，伙计 你也参赛吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.20,0:42:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.37,0:42:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我大概二十多年前开车撞了墙？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.81,0:42:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,从那时到现在，我只负责组织和收款
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.51,0:42:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰，听着 他会在这里呆上一阵
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.31,0:42:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能否在你这小住一段时间？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.05,0:42:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的地方怎么啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.05,0:42:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我不想和他呆一起 他有坏习惯
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.22,0:42:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 怎么都好
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.82,0:42:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他周围走走？我很快就上去
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.59,0:42:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.23,0:42:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，谁要机会想赢回钱来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.73,0:42:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样，吉米？以前你看过这样的东西吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.27,0:42:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 两辆车的缠线以前我都没见过
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.44,0:43:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 是的 他们绑定了GPS
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.58,0:43:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 马卡姆 知道我要去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.61,0:43:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,唷，你精通机械 何不试试解了他？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.92,0:43:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试试，但这不简单
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.32,0:43:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那DIS盒子，发动机管理系统 主要是放在…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.86,0:43:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,GPS 的三角架插在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.86,0:43:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，说说你这车哪里来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.86,0:43:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这几天你都哪去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.93,0:43:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你这车哪里来的？- 很不错！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.47,0:43:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是很不错 就是因为很不错 以至于每次你们…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.00,0:43:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,系不系安全带他们都能知道
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.44,0:43:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，吉米，你尽力吧，兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.71,0:43:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.11,0:43:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得把这尽快推广出街
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.15,0:43:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，兄弟，听着
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.15,0:43:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到街那边那辆卡迪拉克了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.06,0:43:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 嗯他们好像自从我们离开 维安后就一直在监视我们
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.34,0:44:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.04,0:44:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.48,0:44:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，我帮你清洗挡风玻璃
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.51,0:44:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.75,0:44:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.22,0:44:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我全部都知道啦，笨蛋 [西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.86,0:44:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼去吧，笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.76,0:44:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.26,0:44:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！走！走！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.37,0:44:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.24,0:44:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想在我们开始之前就起我们底
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.21,0:44:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨，比尔金斯，告诉我有什么不妥？- 我也想知道有什么不妥
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.64,0:44:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起手！快 双手举起！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.78,0:44:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么回事？- 嗨，怎么啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.71,0:44:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你以为你可以射我？我是联邦成员！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.62,0:44:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？把你的手拿开！把你的手拿开！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.75,0:44:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,别以为你穿着警服 就可以进来搅和！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.19,0:45:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把你的手拿开！- 你应该庆幸我没射到你
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.03,0:45:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴，罗！- 别叫我闭嘴，布赖恩！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.73,0:45:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你差点让我们暴露了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.60,0:45:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该在那里出现
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.07,0:45:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么，你不知道维安在试我们？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.27,0:45:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 我以为你们在逃跑 - 逃跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.64,0:45:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 那真是太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.71,0:45:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，如果 罗 要射你，你现在不会站在这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.11,0:45:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们要控制这局面
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.95,0:45:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，那是我的！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.45,0:45:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那又怎么样？- 告诉我你所知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.39,0:45:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗和我会帮维安送货
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.06,0:45:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不确定时间地点 但他说了他给我们买通了关卡
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.73,0:45:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉的肯定是和当地警察串通
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.37,0:45:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以跟当地的一些警察谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.37,0:45:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这样不好 如果 维安 买通了他们
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.57,0:45:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能让他们知道我们的计划
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.67,0:45:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是 另外
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.21,0:45:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,维安 告诉我们说他会亲自在终点等我们
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.95,0:45:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是好消息 如果你们是把毒品的钱带给他
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.42,0:46:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我们就可以逮捕他 - 不，有个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.12,0:46:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么问题？- 芳特斯…维安在拉拢她
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.99,0:46:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拉拢她？如何拉拢她？- 胡扯！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.26,0:46:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？伙计，我们知道我们看到什么
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.76,0:46:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么认为，欧康纳？你认为她在妥协？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.67,0:46:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你应该知道 - 什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.44,0:46:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？你的兄弟欧康纳 没告诉你？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.44,0:46:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在洛杉矶的时候背叛了比尔金斯 把车钥匙给了马库斯让他走了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.21,0:46:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他现在不再是警察
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.15,0:46:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你怎么想？专家
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.02,0:46:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.02,0:46:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们会留意她的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.02,0:46:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.57,0:46:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你放你的兄弟走了，哼？- 别提了 我不想说这个
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.60,0:46:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不提？，妈的，我想知道这事
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.81,0:46:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说，忘记它 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.41,0:47:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道 芳特斯 和 维安相处得很好，马卡姆 试图揭我们的底…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.58,0:47:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们两辆车有监视，真他妈的不比我的那个脚镣差
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.82,0:47:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你，兄弟 如果 马卡姆 再在 维安 面前乱来
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.85,0:47:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那将是我们的死期 - 我知道，我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.42,0:47:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在尽快想办法，我们需要个摆脱困境的办法
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.26,0:47:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要想点脱身之计 - 脱身之计？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.93,0:47:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.20,0:47:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢这个方法 你怎么想的？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.60,0:47:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 但我们需另外两辆车
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.18,0:47:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶 他们来了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.53,0:47:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,芳兹和伐利奥 真高兴你加入
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.44,0:48:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们听说你们想开那些好东西
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.37,0:48:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我只是觉得你们的车 要有更好的司机
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.38,0:48:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们要从你们手里夺过来
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.71,0:48:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 何不现在就来呢？- 等，等等
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.08,0:48:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们和不在路上解决？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.42,0:48:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,每辆车一个来回，接力方式…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.89,0:48:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 输了怎么样 - 输的走路回家
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.09,0:48:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们比过吧 - 好，准备好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.56,0:48:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油，兄弟 赢到这两辆车来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.30,0:48:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，听我说 如果硬碰硬的话 我们没办法赢这帮家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.94,0:48:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的车最高时速能达到425英里…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.37,0:48:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外一辆车5秒就能飙到最高速
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.14,0:48:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须想点办法
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.55,0:48:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想到的唯一的方法就是在回程是加油
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.68,0:48:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 好 加油，兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.15,0:48:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搞定橙色这辆
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.25,0:48:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.76,0:49:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 你们开到街尾的油桶转个圈回来
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.63,0:49:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二个上的 要等你的伙伴越过这条线以后
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.47,0:49:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一个来回两次的算赢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.54,0:49:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,重点是
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.71,0:49:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,输的要把他们的钥匙交处理
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.45,0:49:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然从今天开始 你们就要用吸管吃早饭了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.62,0:49:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.22,0:49:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.16,0:49:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，你也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.89,0:49:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我明白 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.53,0:49:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.57,0:49:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油，宝贝！你行的，罗 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.00,0:49:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，你快走吧，伙计 我赢定了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.48,0:49:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你输定你的车了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.98,0:49:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加油，罗！- 加油 你赢定了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.81,0:49:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我会担心这小子吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.68,0:49:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不值一题
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.66,0:50:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊，不 - 美国肌肉
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.53,0:50:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的引擎 不知道有没有你的嘴那么厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.54,0:50:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞定他们 搞定他们 搞定他们
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.51,0:50:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好，我们开始吧 - 好，宝贝 让我来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.65,0:50:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.75,0:50:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,预备… 开始！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.09,0:50:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没够料 我才是这条街的老大
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.04,0:50:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔-噢！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.70,0:50:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没听见吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.16,0:51:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.33,0:51:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.57,0:51:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定追到你 哦，我一定追到你！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.14,0:51:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个大嘴哪去了，伙计？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.11,0:51:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的车跟我回家
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.29,0:51:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，妈的 试试这个，小子！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.64,0:51:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.04,0:52:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶，伙计！上！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.88,0:52:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，伙计 后尾尘味道怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.45,0:52:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.52,0:52:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，罗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.52,0:52:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊…好身手，小子 瞧瞧你有没有胆量 来啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.84,0:53:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.45,0:53:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！快！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.46,0:53:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油，布赖恩 赢回家
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.30,0:54:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢了两辆新车！都是我的啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.34,0:54:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.15,0:54:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还没够格 走回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.49,0:54:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,做巴士去吧，伙计！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.83,0:54:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.37,0:54:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 能帮你什么吗？- 我们是 维安 的客人
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.94,0:54:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好多美女啊 - 是
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.02,0:54:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 机会大把啊 - 该死的 你有笔吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.52,0:54:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都快忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.89,0:55:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧那个在那旋转的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.36,0:55:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你们干得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.43,0:55:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 维安 从不邀请工人参加这样的活动 - 那你怎么会在这？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.90,0:55:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在哪？- 他在路上
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.57,0:55:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你和 维安 不是形影不离的吗？- 你这是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.24,0:55:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.61,0:55:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈 我去小个便
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.11,0:55:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.32,0:55:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他到底怎么啦？- 他不相信警察的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.72,0:55:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说你的事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.49,0:55:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我当过两个月的警察…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.70,0:55:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗在一次车库搜查中被抓
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.07,0:55:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,被查出有8个来历不明的轮胎
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.67,0:55:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以你揭露了他？- 不 我根本不知道发生什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.87,0:55:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但确实和他有关
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.84,0:55:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上，一旦我成了警察
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.41,0:55:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗就把我从朋友当成敌人了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.75,0:56:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有点…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.39,0:56:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么我可以帮忙吗？维安先生
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.13,0:56:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫他们过拉见我
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.47,0:56:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，是的 我很欣赏
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.54,0:56:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，我早些时候也在找
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.55,0:56:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死的 - 我不打算给你
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.92,0:56:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么啦？- 他来了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.09,0:56:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在哪？- 他在那边 别往那边看
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.39,0:56:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，维安先生邀请你们过去
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.16,0:56:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.23,0:56:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我在说什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.80,0:56:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 让他们进来
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.24,0:57:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐吧 我马上和你谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.61,0:57:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好吗？- 很好 今晚尽兴吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.81,0:57:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 今晚玩得很开心 - 嗯，好
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.52,0:57:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很美，是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.09,0:57:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哼？- 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.76,0:57:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很美
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.14,0:57:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很有胆量，小子
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.84,0:57:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很欣赏
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.38,0:57:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人有很强的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.21,0:57:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到那边和一位先生 坐在一起的金发女郎了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.12,0:57:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只需只需5分钟，就能从他身上得到她想要的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.83,0:57:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢你的头发 - 瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.74,0:57:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道他们会去哪里 坐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.81,0:58:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个家伙，令我手下的车起火了，是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.01,0:58:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我干的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.32,0:58:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你瞧，我不喜欢被管制的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.72,0:58:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，我也有同样的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.16,0:58:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我，是警察在捣乱
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.44,0:58:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们走走吧 来 - 我们不是要来这吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.18,0:58:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在要走了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.25,0:58:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.59,0:58:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 走
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.31,0:59:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.39,0:59:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来点小乐子
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.89,0:59:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.53,0:59:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再待一会嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.44,0:59:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，卡特
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.57,0:59:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，这是怀特五兹探长
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.24,0:59:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈阿密的一个警察 谢谢，甜心
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.88,0:59:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 玩得开心吗，探长？- 是的 我很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.89,0:59:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意思是，你了解我
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.62,0:59:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，我确实了解你
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.66,1:00:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你花我的钱很久了 - 维安，这可不对
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.10,1:00:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.10,1:00:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你最好一件任务，探长 听到吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.30,1:00:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们已经谈过了 - 是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.37,1:00:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我说过我干不了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.41,1:00:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,唔 错了 上桌
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.55,1:00:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是探长，维安！你对我干任何事
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.89,1:00:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察马上就会找上你的麻烦
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.22,1:00:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上你的嘴！你这只肥猪
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.79,1:00:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,快停手
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.57,1:00:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是…那是什么鬼东西？- 坐下
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.31,1:00:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会后悔的 快住手！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.74,1:00:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,探长，一旦铁桶够热
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.98,1:00:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,老鼠就会想爬出来
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.38,1:00:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿开…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.22,1:01:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个方向可以去 你的身体
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.42,1:01:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨！拿开…嗨！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.39,1:01:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,扶住
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.26,1:01:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拿开！我不会追究的 - 闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.53,1:01:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知不知道一只普通的老鼠…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.03,1:01:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,能啃破钢质的水管？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.10,1:01:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必担心它尖叫的，探长
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.57,1:01:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他啃的时候它就会安静下来的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.71,1:01:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,停！停！停！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.54,1:01:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那么愚蠢 快停手
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.95,1:01:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你负责的警队看管我的货，哼？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.85,1:01:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要的是，15分钟的空闲…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.29,1:01:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部人…我要全部的人…消失
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.79,1:01:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你听见吗？- 我办不到！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.96,1:01:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 停 我办不到 救命啊！- 好 莫尼卡，过来
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.80,1:01:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 救命啊！救命啊！- 把他嘴闭上
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.27,1:01:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊！救命啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.37,1:01:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.31,1:01:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊！救命啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.14,1:02:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在咬我
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.91,1:02:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 救命啊！救命啊！- 怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.45,1:02:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.89,1:02:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在咬我
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.56,1:02:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好，我干！- 干什么？说
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.89,1:02:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我干 我给你空闲时间
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.16,1:02:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把它拿开！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.93,1:02:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿开
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.40,1:02:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出卖我
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.91,1:02:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老鼠…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.64,1:02:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会拜访你的妻子，林恩… 唔…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.94,1:02:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的儿子，莱克，还有你的女儿，莱西
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.41,1:02:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到吗？你明白我在说什么吗？哼？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.28,1:02:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你听到吗？- 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.09,1:02:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把你的眼睛烤出来！把你的眼睛烤出来
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.52,1:02:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,快拿开
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.62,1:02:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 现在你可以走了 - 快拿走
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.70,1:02:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把那老鼠拿开 我们走 - 快拿开
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.47,1:03:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 你们喜欢这表演吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.48,1:03:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,15分钟，佛罗里达 全部的警察都拿你们没办法
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.71,1:03:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,后天早上6点在凡尔赛咖啡厅，准备好行动
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.65,1:03:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白吗？- 是
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.85,1:03:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别和我耍花样，否则你们就是这样的下场，明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.99,1:03:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,自便和点香槟吧 我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.30,1:03:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是个该死的老鼠，伙计
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.30,1:03:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.14,1:03:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再碰其他的男人，我就杀了你
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.95,1:03:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到吗？看着我
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.25,1:03:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.99,1:03:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她和他是一伙的，伙计 这是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.13,1:04:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也看到她掐住那家伙的头
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.73,1:04:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她逼不得已的 他在试她 你要记得
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.57,1:04:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也处于危险之中，就像我们一样
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.24,1:04:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太沉迷于这女人了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.34,1:04:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跟当年那个疯人托雅差不多
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.14,1:04:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,托雅？你不也跟着我追求她
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.58,1:04:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能浪费她啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.78,1:04:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赢你了 我赢你了 我赢你了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.92,1:04:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗？- 看，我们能靠赛车挣钱
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.96,1:04:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但当我踩油门的时候，我好运到来了，你只好乖乖服输
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.13,1:04:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 泰，你快输掉你的车间了 - 管他呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.80,1:04:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是个穷机械工，但我却超支
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.97,1:04:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,给钱！快，伙计！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.04,1:04:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,快给我钱 我告诉过你，伙计
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.10,1:04:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个开心的家伙 我很开心
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.17,1:04:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的车库 同花大顺！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.34,1:04:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给我 - 噢，哼！正！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.48,1:04:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有警告过他吗？说过 - 该死的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.11,1:04:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能参进来 把钱放台上 你知道我的下一手牌呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.92,1:04:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉米，如果你一直这样输给泰 你怎么还我钱？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.75,1:04:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗，兄弟 我就快破产了，泰
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.89,1:04:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我明天找你 - 好
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.07,1:05:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在这干什么？- 布赖恩，他们要杀了你
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.14,1:05:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到他下令艾礼馗和罗伯托
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.65,1:05:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦你完成任务，他们就杀了你
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.48,1:05:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你确定你没听错？- 我肯定 我肯定
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.26,1:05:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,维安 的马子在外面…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.50,1:05:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，我知道他们在找什么… 你的女朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.31,1:05:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们不知道我在这 我偷遛出来的 - 那他们来这干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.21,1:05:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 也许他们猜的 - 嗨，去拖住他们
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.48,1:05:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去拖住他们一会 - 小心她，小心她
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.69,1:06:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在找什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.33,1:06:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，伙伴 嘿，伙计 你在这干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.33,1:06:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，你还在计较我烧你的车？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.07,1:06:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那么认真 伙计 开个玩笑都不行？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.20,1:06:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,布赖恩，别管这是做个好警察 或者是干你的工作
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.91,1:06:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要杀了你 你们要脱身了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.04,1:06:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,维安 难道花钱叫你们成天紧绷着脸吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.25,1:06:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我赚得到钱的话，首先就把那颗痣从鼻子上除掉
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.32,1:06:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吗？好吗 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.72,1:06:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他到底给你们多少钱？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.82,1:06:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次看见你们，你们都是穿丝质衬衫
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.39,1:06:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,珠宝，你瞧，整个迈阿密风格
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.23,1:06:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？我看见你们走进俱乐部的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.63,1:06:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的大肥肉看得清清楚楚，知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.03,1:06:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,别替他们送货，布赖恩 别替他们送货
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.00,1:06:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.07,1:06:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.84,1:07:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- [西班牙语] - 你不可以上我的…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.81,1:07:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.29,1:07:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨，嗨！你要去哪？- 你给我待在这，伙计
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.10,1:07:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,想也别想
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.88,1:07:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- [西班牙语] - 快滚开我朋友的船
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.95,1:07:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪放下！把枪放下！马上！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.59,1:07:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先，笨蛋！你先
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.76,1:07:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会杀了他！把枪放下！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.16,1:07:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.16,1:07:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.97,1:07:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把枪放下！- [西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.07,1:07:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- [西班牙语] - 把枪放下！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.77,1:08:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.84,1:08:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 够了 闭嘴 - [西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.91,1:08:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 结束了 过来
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.78,1:08:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了 我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.15,1:08:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿上枪 来 我们走 我们走 走
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.29,1:08:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,真高兴你们两个家伙相处得那么好
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.63,1:08:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为明天，罗伯托和艾礼馗…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.73,1:08:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,会和你们一起上路…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.80,1:08:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是为了没有任何麻烦
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.93,1:08:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们迟点见
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.87,1:08:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她来这搞什么鬼？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.79,1:08:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你早上去哪了？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.42,1:08:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和朋友去吃早晨
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.40,1:09:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,和朋友？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.67,1:09:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有朋友，卡特
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.84,1:09:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我迟点找你
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.56,1:09:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好衬衣，比尔金斯 - 今天我放假
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.56,1:09:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 嗯，无论如何，事情是这样的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.16,1:09:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚，维安 威胁一个警察 给我们一段“方便”时间
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.30,1:09:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将开车到飞机跑道，通过诺木大街外的基士大街
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.27,1:09:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,维安 在那准备好了飞机 就在那准备好起飞
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.81,1:09:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 你怎么知道的？- 莫尼卡
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.74,1:09:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,她做她的工作 她警告我们
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.41,1:09:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她警告你们什么？- 维安 计划我们给了他钱以后杀了我们
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.22,1:09:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,自投罗网不是交易的部分
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.09,1:09:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我决定取消行动！- 绝对不行！这是海关的行动！比尔金斯
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.72,1:10:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人可以停止行动，除了我
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.66,1:10:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着！这很简单
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.03,1:10:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们去开车，把钱给他…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.13,1:10:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就能抓人
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.13,1:10:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好不好？如果你们不干的话，我会给 你们安上足够的罪名让你们永远消失
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.54,1:10:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着 我们得用GPS随时监视你们…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.54,1:10:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,确定你们不耍花样
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.61,1:10:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 同时确保他们不会出事，对吗？- 是
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.29,1:10:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真是个杂种 - 是
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.16,1:10:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我这么说吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.43,1:10:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们不干的话，我们就得坐牢
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.50,1:10:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是如果我们干的话，维安'就会干掉我们
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.57,1:10:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个他妈的交易啊，哼？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.80,1:10:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 也许真的很难搞
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.11,1:10:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道他很有钱…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.18,1:10:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,想都放到我们车上
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.91,1:10:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想到两个原因 为什么 维安 不再需要钱
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.95,1:11:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊，我们行动吧 - 你和我
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.69,1:11:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像以前那样 你怎么想？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.96,1:11:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为他们找错人了 我是这样想的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.30,1:11:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 唷，泰 你好吗？兄弟 - 怎么啦？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.60,1:11:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，你能多快组织起来？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.80,1:11:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，伙计，如果你真的要执行这计划
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.04,1:11:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,明确了最好的地点
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.60,1:11:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们怎么认为？- 我认为很好 他们在这储藏什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.30,1:11:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞定
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.70,1:11:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，吉米
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.77,1:11:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是 怎么啦？- 我们还有没有半满瓶的氮气？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.17,1:11:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然，但我已经载入在你的车子了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.81,1:11:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我要用来干其他的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.11,1:12:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们的车可能会有点挤，知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.35,1:12:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候你开始吃这么多？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.26,1:12:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我坐过牢
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.46,1:12:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道里面的食物是多么地差
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.83,1:12:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,照现在事情发展的趋势
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.40,1:12:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要么就进监狱，要么就死
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.77,1:12:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我能吃的时候就尽量吃
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.44,1:12:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,再加上医生告诉我，我新陈代谢很快
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.05,1:12:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得我们是一起长大的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.12,1:12:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起在沙地上踢足球
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.19,1:12:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起惹麻烦，经历一切愚蠢的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.53,1:12:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你破产的时候，你知道，无论我是不是警察
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.96,1:12:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有什么事我做得到的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.07,1:12:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就会去做，我只想你知道
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.30,1:13:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你在洛杉矶的时候就放了那家伙？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.81,1:13:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我认为解决问题有多种方式
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.98,1:13:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我倒闭的时候，那并不是你的错
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.78,1:13:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都怪我，罗马皮斯…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.49,1:13:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,生性野蛮的狂人
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.09,1:13:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁的话我都不听
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.73,1:13:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 独来独往 - 是，嗯，以后再也不是了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.27,1:13:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不是了，兄弟
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.63,1:14:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,维安车离开了他的住所
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.00,1:14:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 长官，我们收到维安正去飞机跑道
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.90,1:14:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们突袭他 告诉他别靠太近
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.34,1:14:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 装备好 准备出发 - 频道二 频道二
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.61,1:14:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 都准备好 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.45,1:14:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好了？- 是的 出发吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.85,1:14:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,报告
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.32,1:14:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面情况怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.60,1:14:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 1小队准备好了 - 2小队准备好了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.80,1:14:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 3小队准备好了 - 4小队 全部到位
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.84,1:14:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,5小队准备好了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.90,1:14:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,6小队 就位
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.88,1:14:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 出发 - 是，你知道怎么做啦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.98,1:14:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持冷静，集中精神
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.82,1:14:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住，飞机跑道在诺木大街
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.19,1:14:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,过桥后第三个出口
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.02,1:15:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白 - 还好吗？伙计，准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.93,1:15:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 枪支，杀人犯，坏警察？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.30,1:15:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不怕
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.07,1:15:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.82,1:16:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.99,1:16:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,维安 的拖车里面有情况
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.03,1:16:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我下命令之前不要轻举妄动
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.90,1:16:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.74,1:16:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.69,1:16:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.86,1:16:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,放上车去
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.90,1:16:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部单位注意，马上到拖车那 行动！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.11,1:16:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！当地警察去我们的人那里了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.21,1:17:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 3包都在同一个车？哼？- 猜猜会怎样
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.06,1:17:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.33,1:17:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不想再回到监狱 - 你去哪伙计！快走，走
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.97,1:17:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语] 他在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.99,1:17:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，现在让直升机跟着他们 就在他们头顶上
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.50,1:17:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 L25，跟踪 GPS
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.28,1:18:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你在干什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.28,1:18:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着我，罗 跟着我 快
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.19,1:18:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在I-95街上正朝南面走
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.73,1:18:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,空中监控报道
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.24,1:18:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，妈的！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.78,1:18:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们追上来了！- 闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.79,1:18:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 耶，好车技，罗 好车技 - 我赶上你了，布赖恩
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.47,1:19:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你瞧，伙计！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.35,1:19:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.46,1:19:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，妈的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.78,1:19:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来，扶住方向盘 - 不 我不会开
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.01,1:19:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 扶住方向盘就行！- 我不会！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.21,1:19:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,扶住这里！只需稳住它，就这样
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.38,1:19:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.06,1:20:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.61,1:20:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！耶！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.29,1:21:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.13,1:21:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔金斯，小鸟到了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.14,1:21:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶 我们看到维安的车了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.47,1:21:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 钱还在路上 潜伏好
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.45,1:22:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个好车手，伙计
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.69,1:22:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢，兄弟
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.26,1:22:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们前面的路都封锁了 他们没地方逃了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.97,1:22:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.91,1:22:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了 视频马上就来
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.98,1:22:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们看到了 看起来很好
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.89,1:22:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要去哪？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.20,1:22:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，妈的！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.84,1:23:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，迈阿密警察，看你们追不追得上
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.91,1:23:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 跟我来，伙计
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.21,1:23:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨，伙计 人都到了 好戏该上演了 - 让他们瞧瞧吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.66,1:23:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 派对开始吧 走
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.28,1:23:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是 2599 单位 我们包围嫌疑犯了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.60,1:24:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.47,1:24:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦天啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.11,1:24:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,真混乱，宝贝 真大场面！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.32,1:24:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶！来吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.16,1:25:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,快瞧！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.00,1:25:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在视频上追逐不到他们
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.04,1:25:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,混乱中丢失了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.97,1:25:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.61,1:25:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.30,1:25:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.49,1:26:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们发现他们了，去住西海滩
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.39,1:26:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 我会跟上的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.57,1:26:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,海关盯住两辆往西去海滩的车
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.11,1:26:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 收到 跟住它 - 收到
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.97,1:26:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 他们被逼到无路可走了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.87,1:27:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你们的手放到我们能看到的地方！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.88,1:27:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 举起手！- 喔 伙计
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.38,1:27:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我的车牌过期了，但是，该死的！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.59,1:27:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么回事？他们哪去了？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.45,1:27:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场秀怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.92,1:27:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶！你的司机怎么样，宝贝！是不是很爽啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.46,1:27:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干得好，伙计 - 算不了什么
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.69,1:27:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就像是个石脸杀手
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.76,1:27:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才稳抓安全带的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.83,1:27:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，泰 非常感谢 你太棒了 我欠你个大人情
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.80,1:28:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，布赖恩，你确实欠我个人情
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.04,1:28:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确实欠…我们 舒琪说你欠我们，对不？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.51,1:28:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 唷，罗 你听到吗？回话 - 怎么啦，伙计？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.48,1:28:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只剩下最后一个计划了，哼？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.68,1:28:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,乐意奉陪，兄弟 干吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.55,1:28:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 要乘我们还有能力的时候抓了 维安 - 不 还不行
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.89,1:28:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？你们跟失了他们？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.40,1:28:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！那些混蛋逃了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.80,1:28:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听你的 我们现在怎么办？- 我们把他拿下
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.23,1:28:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不能离开这里
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.30,1:28:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐得过瘾吗？很快是吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.14,1:28:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,技术是一流的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.04,1:28:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,守旧派 美国肌肉
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.68,1:28:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计，这车能做任何的事
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.48,1:28:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,想见识一下吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.02,1:28:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这松开
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.02,1:28:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 唷！你想干什么？- 闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.10,1:29:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.90,1:29:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,果然有效！我喜欢这个按钮！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.11,1:29:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖乖呆在那里吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.71,1:29:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧康纳，搞定了，宝贝
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.45,1:29:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,送他出去了 我这搞掂了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.52,1:29:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们在那里见 快点，伙计 - 好 伙计
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.29,1:29:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗？行动！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.03,1:29:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抄这边！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.70,1:29:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起手来！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.07,1:29:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬下！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.14,1:29:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,清场！我们清场了！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.74,1:29:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.04,1:29:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 维安 和 芳特斯不在这 - 你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.98,1:29:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他们哪去了？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.92,1:30:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,在前面大海鲢处下高速
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.13,1:30:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,大海鲢？那不是…去飞机跑道的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.36,1:30:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说要去飞机跑道那的？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.35,1:30:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,布赖恩 布赖恩，怎么啦？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.98,1:30:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗，有新计划 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.65,1:30:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在大海鲢的高速出口碰面，不是去飞机跑道
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.26,1:30:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在说什么？- 新计划
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.80,1:30:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,布赖恩 布赖恩，哈罗？你听到吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.03,1:30:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死的！- 他搞什么鬼？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.47,1:30:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦人员搞错地方了 布赖恩的女人和 维安 一伙的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.11,1:30:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那… - 布赖恩 不会来这了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.49,1:31:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 让他出来 - 出来
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.57,1:31:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,把箱子拿出来 [西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.17,1:31:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.16,1:31:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 其他的呢？- 另外一辆车
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.33,1:31:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 另外一辆车 另外一辆车在哪？- 在路上
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.73,1:31:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在路上，是吗？- 是 这是你的钱
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.90,1:31:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对那些监视我的飞机的探员一无所知？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.38,1:32:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有趣的是我只告诉 过一个人关于飞机跑道的事
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.86,1:32:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.93,1:32:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,海关人员越来越厉害了，是不？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.54,1:32:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她上船
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.31,1:32:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走 - 上船
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.96,1:32:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 藏好车，干了他 - 回车里去
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.69,1:33:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,到尽头了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.13,1:33:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道，我喜欢你，但我还是要杀了你
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.66,1:33:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的工作
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.13,1:33:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.44,1:33:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么？- 快动手，宝贝！太糟糕了！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.78,1:33:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.00,1:34:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿开你的…哦，妈的！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.05,1:34:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,来
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.28,1:34:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你差点骗了我
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.78,1:34:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你犯错了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.02,1:34:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,11个半月里面你就犯了这一次错
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.19,1:35:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她下去
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.70,1:35:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟点见
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.87,1:35:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我以为你死了 - 我也以为我死定了 谢谢你救了我
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.91,1:35:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在干什么，布赖恩？- 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.61,1:35:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果 维安 遇到海关的 直升飞机或者船，她救死定了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.98,1:35:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,艇 车
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.88,1:35:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,艇… 你不会想我想象的那样干吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.05,1:35:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是，我想是 你支持我吗？- 是
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.29,1:35:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 系好安全带 - 给他们点真颜色看看
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.33,1:35:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们大干一场吧 坐稳 罗 坐稳
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.43,1:35:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！布赖恩，你疯了吗！你要干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.77,1:35:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,布赖恩，你要干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.85,1:35:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.08,1:36:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.50,1:36:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的手臂 我想我的手臂断了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.81,1:36:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿住枪
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.33,1:36:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了，卡特
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.58,1:37:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗？- 是
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.15,1:37:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.09,1:37:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们赢了，我们赢了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.66,1:37:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们出去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.05,1:37:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！走！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.16,1:37:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该这样
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.19,1:37:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,总共有三袋，哼？船上搜出三袋钱
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.03,1:37:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们没事了，是吗？我们的档案会清了对吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.30,1:38:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们坚持到了最后 你的案底已经撤销了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.56,1:38:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许应该是6袋
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.69,1:38:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们扯平了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.03,1:38:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当长官 - 在
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.67,1:38:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到更多的证据
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.54,1:38:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 拿上货车去
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.75,1:38:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去后别那么拽
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.18,1:38:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你知道，他出来以后一定会杀了你
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.62,1:38:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会再出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.49,1:38:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们很快又见面的 - 你认为他会出来？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.13,1:39:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会出来的
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.60,1:39:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，说真的，他会出来？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.97,1:39:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们处理了你们的档案 你们自由和洗清罪名了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.24,1:39:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面的车是送你的
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.47,1:39:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去修好他吧 - 好
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.88,1:39:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢，比尔金斯 你真好人 - 不客气
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.31,1:39:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你照顾 - 还好
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.28,1:39:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在信任我了吗？- 你还好
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.03,1:39:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 干得太棒了，欧康纳
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.63,1:39:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼此彼此
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.88,1:39:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我必须离开这里
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.04,1:39:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,以免你惹上麻烦，兄弟
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.55,1:39:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我在说什么吗
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.42,1:39:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你要离开迈阿密吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.49,1:40:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱迈阿密
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.56,1:40:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我迷上迈阿密了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.29,1:40:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一起开间汽车修理厂怎么样 - 修理厂？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.83,1:40:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么开？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.04,1:40:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,口袋不是空的，笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.98,1:40:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也不会再挨饿了，兄弟
